#: search2:search2_92927362_E2C1_4E68_9DEE_63E8053449DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e4495b91c0919064b470f6bd3c1ba710a635a5ce342552ca2c97825ced5fe82
#. default-sha256: e6f9a59c9cef5672080f23db40dab5c82440b07121b74aea107c757654755579
msgctxt "search2:search2_92927362_E2C1_4E68_9DEE_63E8053449DB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“I carry within me the child of God!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“Porto in grembo il figlio di Dio!”"

#: search2:search2_A84944D9_4058_413F_9EE5_317AF8A5127D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04ec29d793eb7349779de268b45244ed3cb2eb75941c263a5bd82aedb9ed5303
#. default-sha256: 0d64e05011abc86fbe8c6f5566ca3f4f9fe3e546e1e8153324de013b6621051a
msgctxt "search2:search2_A84944D9_4058_413F_9EE5_317AF8A5127D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That is where it all began."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Fu allora che tutto ebbe inizio."

#: search2:search2_F45BFCD5_8F99_4CBB_828C_9B089850B9D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7627ac652789d7878b78642a8bb5e4272dbd8deb50a943b6afd9c67df62513ea
#. default-sha256: d969004cb4d03a55bc9d68b058c37481a1613f9a9592e910e9bf51115ae6c712
msgctxt "search2:search2_F45BFCD5_8F99_4CBB_828C_9B089850B9D0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I have been visited by an angel of the Lord!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Un angelo del Signore è venuto a farmi visita!”"

#: search2:search2_C26E89B7_CD1C_450D_9AF6_8974349761C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce0fe54b1a5e58b0efb620ee5af5e1d4a3562ff90166904fc8aff3dc7a3acce5
#. default-sha256: fa997ff96fd4de84512f0c419e99899f2b66902cb277505cabfb24d234db2426
msgctxt "search2:search2_C26E89B7_CD1C_450D_9AF6_8974349761C3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Ahh, she is the child of God!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Ahh, lei è la figlia di Dio!”"

#: search2:search2_AEBF2782_1A37_447F_BB82_D469D662019C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f1362e97dd59757642b2edcf5bf4ad9947e82c7e765afcee8c1fc94bf82a3eb
#. default-sha256: 2c78efef768cad54d617ef645e25d1d4bc7adb74695455065b029a0e6775b73e
msgctxt "search2:search2_AEBF2782_1A37_447F_BB82_D469D662019C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I am with child, though I have known no man”? ⟪k:1⟫Ahaha... as if that’s even possible.⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Maybe she had fooled around with a man who had gone and abandoned her, ⟪k:5⟫and she "
"spouted those lies to convince herself it had never happened.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫None of the "
"village men made any claim to be my father. ⟪k:10⟫Perhaps he was someone else’s husband, and as "
"such, he ⟪k:11⟫couldn’t⟪k:12⟫ reveal himself, as adultery is a sin in the eyes of God.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫The girl they were praising as the “child of God” was, indeed, naught more than the "
"ordinary daughter of a wretched woman."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Aspetto un bambino, nonostante non sia stata con nessun uomo”? ⟪k:1⟫Ahaha... come se fosse "
"possibile.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Forse se l’era spassata con un uomo che l’aveva poi abbandonata,⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫e avrà raccontato quelle bugie per convincersi che non fosse mai successo.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫Nessuno degli uomini del villaggio affermò di essere mio padre. ⟪k:11⟫Forse era il marito "
"di qualcun’altra, e in quanto tale, ⟪k:12⟫non poteva⟪k:13⟫ farsi avanti, essendo l’adulterio un "
"peccato agli occhi di Dio.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫La bambina che stavano lodando come la “figlia "
"di Dio”, in realtà, non era altro che la figlia di una donna squallida."

#: search2:search2_AF36E4C0_7E91_4143_A35A_B06C398BCF5C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83739176a1eacdeeb12c47d697965d7628ddec54cc82c209aa73ff518182fc06
#. default-sha256: 58d655ba082d58027a3da707e79a1d16a2d4d4631725c2fb69ed6bdf0517ef14
msgctxt "search2:search2_AF36E4C0_7E91_4143_A35A_B06C398BCF5C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫At the time, though, I thought differently.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I believed my mother’s words, "
"convinced I was a saint. ⟪k:5⟫And it gave me a sense of duty—of purpose—rather than superiority. "
"⟪k:6⟫As the daughter of God, I believed it was my responsibility to help anyone in need.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫So every day, I prayed. ⟪k:10⟫I asked my Father what I could do—what I was ⟪k:11⟫meant⟪k:12⟫ "
"to do.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Not everyone is equally good, however. There will always be someone "
"who lends their ear to the Devil’s whispers. ⟪k:17⟫One man claimed I was the daughter of a "
"charlatan. ⟪k:18⟫He shouted for all to hear, “If you really are the child of God, then perform a "
"miracle for us.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Al tempo, tuttavia, la pensavo diversamente.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Credevo alle parole di mia "
"madre, ed ero convinta di essere una santa. ⟪k:5⟫Ciò mi diede un senso del dovere—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫uno "
"scopo—⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫piuttosto che un senso di superiorità. ⟪k:10⟫In quanto figlia di Dio, pensavo "
"fosse mia responsabilità aiutare chiunque ne avesse bisogno.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫E così pregai ogni "
"giorno. ⟪k:14⟫Chiesi a mio Padre cosa potessi fare—⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫cos’ero ⟪k:17⟫destinata⟪k:18⟫ a "
"fare.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Tuttavia, non tutti sono buoni allo stesso modo. Ci sarà sempre "
"qualcuno che tenderà le orecchie ai sussurri del Diavolo.⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫Un uomo sosteneva che fossi "
"la figlia di una ciarlatana. ⟪k:25⟫Urlava affinché tutti potessero sentirlo, “Se sei davvero la "
"figlia di Dio, allora esegui un miracolo per noi”."

#: search2:search2_C7551378_9D24_43BA_93F2_DF242D91D40C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0d0b55403cad7e6b6369b5185e339c8834a12ca8ea58b7efe197c6f6865b927
#. default-sha256: bd973c5d97c055ad784d9a8b5a0134ec512f2bcc7bf20e9459142796ef575905
msgctxt "search2:search2_C7551378_9D24_43BA_93F2_DF242D91D40C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Could he have been any more unreasonable?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Miracles are neither magic nor "
"parlor tricks; ⟪k:4⟫they are realized through the power of faith. ⟪k:5⟫A lowly villager has no "
"place demanding God prove His own divinity. ⟪k:6⟫It is the height of arrogance.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫But "
"the man refused to heed my words, ⟪k:10⟫so, having no other choice,⟪k:11⟫I contemplated what I "
"could do to show him I was, indeed, a saint.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫And blood was the spark of my "
"inspiration."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Poteva essere più irragionevole di così?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I miracoli non sono né magie né "
"trucchetti da quattro soldi;⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫vengono eseguiti attraverso il potere della fede. ⟪k:6⟫Un "
"misero paesano⟪k:7⟫non può pretendere che Dio dimostri la propria natura divina.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"È⟪k:11⟫ il massimo dell’arroganza.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Ma l’uomo si rifiutò di dare ascolto alle mie "
"parole, ⟪k:15⟫perciò, non avendo altra scelta, meditai su cosa avrei potuto fare per dimostrargli "
"che ero una santa.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫E il sangue era la scintilla della mia ispirazione."

#: search2:search2_F4EFC2B5_1D15_473B_860F_F1713F2F9BE0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 901095d69139e6ce36d01aa4f5a08e7acde84ba1cc05a313235cf391f64fe0ab
#. default-sha256: a790d28d2fac0c3f77a32645d2f89246bf1e0dc1acf31c9d07e5b09f4084a2e2
msgctxt "search2:search2_F4EFC2B5_1D15_473B_860F_F1713F2F9BE0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫For my demonstration, I chose an elderly woman afflicted with a terrible disease. ⟪k:2⟫"
"She was on her deathbed, and no one thought she would live for longer than another day or two."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫The woman was overjoyed when I came to visit her. ⟪k:7⟫Sincerely believing me "
"to be a holy servant of the Lord, she gathered all the strength she could muster to climb from "
"her bed and kiss my feet.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I felt an intensely deep love for this woman.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫Placing my hands upon her cheeks, I said with all the kindness in my heart,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Per la mia dimostrazione, scelsi una donna anziana afflitta da una terribile malattia. "
"⟪k:2⟫Era sul letto di morte, e nessuno pensava che avrebbe vissuto più di un altro giorno o due."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫La donna era contentissima quando andai a trovarla.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Credendo "
"sinceramente che fossi una sacra servitrice del Signore, raccolse tutte le forze che aveva per "
"alzarsi dal letto e mi baciò i piedi.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Provai un profondo amore per quella donna.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Poggiando le mie mani sulle sue guance, dissi con tutta la gentilezza nel mio "
"cuore,"

#: search2:search2_02E51490_984D_46B5_828E_15AC21AB4FEE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 849d8be6dcd6dc25582277e3f31aa53daa481700bb72c096c6ee2db7d659ba5a
#. default-sha256: 0bd4053a70ffc9459e81f39103897d1943ffed2cdf627f8a9eb0b3392b99e490
msgctxt "search2:search2_02E51490_984D_46B5_828E_15AC21AB4FEE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“My beloved sister, ⟪k:4⟫partake of my blood.”⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“Mia amata sorella, ⟪k:4⟫prendi il mio sangue.”⟪k:5⟫"

#: search2:search2_C7614FF8_B1F4_4682_B652_1C2D5D133B13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ef50136486e9cec543b5bab5c0df1822c377206ceda2fa711c10be7de8b11cd
#. default-sha256: b9bdd6c806b27dab5409eb8ffcaeff914b0f74fffe1a3befad85cd7e8b51aa1e
msgctxt "search2:search2_C7614FF8_B1F4_4682_B652_1C2D5D133B13"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The woman agreed without a glimpse of hesitation. ⟪k:6⟫And so I "
"pricked the tip of my finger with a knife and let the blood drip into her mouth.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"Within three days, her health had improved enough for her to get out of bed unassisted.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Seeing that, no one in the village doubted my powers any longer. ⟪k:14⟫In fact, "
"the man who had accused me of being “the daughter of a charlatan” was subsequently punished for "
"his sins. ⟪k:15⟫He received much-deserved retribution for challenging the daughter of God—for "
"mocking her.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫But of course, being a saint, I forgave the man. ⟪k:20⟫He, in "
"turn, repented and changed his ways, worshiping me as the true child of God."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫La donna accettò senza un accenno di esitazione. ⟪k:6⟫E così mi "
"tagliai la punta del dito con un coltello, lasciando che il sangue colasse nella sua bocca.⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫In tre giorni, la sua salute migliorò al punto tale da permetterle di alzarsi dal letto "
"senza alcun aiuto.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Vedendo ciò, nessuno nel villaggio dubitò più dei miei "
"poteri.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Anzi, l’uomo che mi accusò di essere “la figlia di una ciarlatana” venne "
"successivamente punito per i suoi peccati. ⟪k:16⟫Ricevette una pena più che meritata per aver "
"sfidato la figlia di Dio—⟪k:17⟫per averla denigrata.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Ma ovviamente, "
"essendo una santa, lo perdonai. ⟪k:22⟫Lui, a sua volta,⟪k:23⟫si pentì e cambiò il proprio "
"giudizio, venerandomi come la vera figlia di Dio."

#: search2:search2_40CC0FB9_61BE_47BD_8D74_485C3F68759F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1fd8a63b6d9b731f0427091d8a175dafe3920e37321429a6c3507869ab8c7ada
#. default-sha256: e1fe8a3ad26fbdbb58d9294a4da1a18d5a05eb073301207035de9ca62197c1eb
msgctxt "search2:search2_40CC0FB9_61BE_47BD_8D74_485C3F68759F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Now, I’ll be honest with you—⟪k:2⟫I was ecstatic. ⟪k:3⟫Utterly elated. ⟪k:4⟫I felt like "
"I was on top of the world, and I reveled in it.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The villagers showered me with "
"adulation. ⟪k:8⟫They revered me—the daughter of God. ⟪k:9⟫Anyone who didn’t was punished.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫And on top of that, my blood could cause miracles.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Tell me, do you "
"look down on me for feeling the way I did? ⟪k:16⟫The ⟪k:17⟫actual⟪k:18⟫ child of God would never "
"let herself be consumed by such base emotions, would she?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sarò sincera con te—⟪k:2⟫ero in estasi. ⟪k:3⟫Ero completamente euforica.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Mi "
"sentivo come se fossi in cima al mondo, e ne godevo.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Gli abitanti del villaggio mi "
"ricoprivano di lusinghe. ⟪k:9⟫Mi riverivano⟪k:10⟫in quanto figlia di Dio. ⟪k:11⟫Chiunque non lo "
"facesse veniva punito.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫E soprattutto, il mio sangue riusciva a fare miracoli."
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Dimmi, mi guardi con disprezzo per essermi sentita in quel modo? ⟪k:18⟫La ⟪k:19⟫"
"vera⟪k:20⟫ figlia di Dio non si sarebbe mai fatta consumare da tali primitive emozioni, no?"

#: search2:search2_77934C7F_F599_4009_A939_24713B872DAC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 595d4b8d1aa51568ae2c5a56563170b1f82a69c324f2bf5ca4d3012f1ac152d3
#. default-sha256: 6e31b7d8a76b3668e881aa2f78c6f4a541fcf2cb938026d503373e1c23a1a73c
msgctxt "search2:search2_77934C7F_F599_4009_A939_24713B872DAC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It is not my place to decide whether my blood truly had miraculous powers or not. ⟪k:2⟫"
"If you think it did, then it did, and if you think it was all happenstance, then so it was.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Miracles are brought about by faith... ⟪k:6⟫so the elderly woman who was healed was "
"done so by the power of her own belief. ⟪k:7⟫Baseless hope and desire can, at times, make the "
"otherwise impossible reality.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫You understand just how major a role religion "
"played in our time, don’t you, Michel? ⟪k:12⟫Especially as someone whose life was taken from him "
"in the name of God.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫And you understand how powerful word of mouth can be as "
"well, don’t you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non spetta a me decidere se il mio sangue avesse davvero poteri miracolosi oppure no. "
"⟪k:2⟫Se pensi che li avesse, allora li aveva, e se pensi che fosse solo un caso, allora era così."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I miracoli nascono dalla fede... ⟪k:6⟫e l’anziana signora era guarita grazie alla "
"forza del proprio credo. ⟪k:7⟫Speranza e desiderio senza fondamento possono, a volte, realizzare "
"ciò che altrimenti sarebbe impossibile.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Tu ⟪k:12⟫sai⟪k:13⟫ quanto fosse "
"importante il ruolo della religione ai nostri tempi, vero, Michel? ⟪k:14⟫D’altronde, ti è stata "
"tolta la vita nel nome di Dio.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫E sai anche quanto possa essere potente il "
"passaparola, giusto?"

#: search2:search2_F7235EA6_F32F_435D_93D6_4B66D7802AD2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: baf546d01acf84dcc5c1b2e48c4f812b1268083ad59ebc461b01e69524b1949c
#. default-sha256: f9b8a35acf48cc67d62d1b57765e4f52dbed824301c00b243c9c17703dddd4a5
msgctxt "search2:search2_F7235EA6_F32F_435D_93D6_4B66D7802AD2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There were some for whom no miracle took place, but whenever that would happen the "
"villagers would come out and say, “The daughter of God is not to blame; you simply lack "
"sufficient faith.” ⟪k:2⟫Thus, such incidents had no negative effect on my reputation as a saint."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫For three years, I continued doling out blessings."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫C’erano alcuni per cui non ebbe luogo alcun miracolo,⟪k:2⟫ma ogniqualvolta ciò accadeva "
"gli abitanti del villaggio dicevano:⟪k:3⟫“Non è colpa della figlia di Dio; è solo che non hai "
"abbastanza fede”. ⟪k:4⟫Pertanto, tali incidenti non avevano alcun effetto negativo sulla mia "
"reputazione come santa.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Per tre anni, continuai ad elargire benedizioni."

#: search2:search2_4297A524_1A44_4DFC_8149_BC08F0C17B25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e824d8cc837cc1199b2e4e588cc6ae04928c8ef215e0061a0a28efc3496770bd
#. default-sha256: 8d7ebbc4009c8753039ad6b3079efbe10c9529abf0b1a748949509c06afc253a
msgctxt "search2:search2_4297A524_1A44_4DFC_8149_BC08F0C17B25"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫One day, while I was offering a prayer, my mother let slip her discontent:⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫“Why must you hand out miracles for nothing? ⟪k:5⟫Why must you give strangers grace? ⟪k:6⟫We "
"should be getting compensated. ⟪k:7⟫We ⟪k:8⟫deserve⟪k:9⟫ remuneration. ⟪k:10⟫If we charged just a "
"little bit for each blessing, we could be living so much more comfortably.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Un giorno, mentre stavo pregando, mia madre si lasciò andare al proprio sconforto:⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“Perché devi concedere miracoli senza ricevere nulla in cambio? ⟪k:5⟫Perché devi donare "
"la grazia a degli sconosciuti? ⟪k:6⟫Dovremmo farci pagare. ⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Meritiamo⟪k:9⟫ un compenso. "
"⟪k:10⟫Se mettessimo un piccolo prezzo⟪k:11⟫ad ogni benedizione, potremmo vivere molto più "
"agiatamente.”"

#: search2:search2_7E03B668_2332_464F_A3C6_D3A85FD3F6C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb4f37466f240654779fee930603e427744fc9138586f57964bc87351ff81cc7
#. default-sha256: 68a465ea2c0ca335588e32c1598e858c7437dc8af796b600210048a1d43dfd52
msgctxt "search2:search2_7E03B668_2332_464F_A3C6_D3A85FD3F6C7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was dumbfounded. ⟪k:2⟫How could the mother of a saint say such things? ⟪k:3⟫Helping "
"people was my divine calling—and she expected ⟪k:4⟫payment⟪k:5⟫?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I nearly wept, "
"hearing my mother preoccupied with such worldly desires.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫So I explained to "
"her how important this work was. ⟪k:13⟫I taught her that we were not to covet material wealth, "
"that we were to dedicate our lives to the service of our fellow man.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫“You’re "
"right, my dear saint,” she said, understanding.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫And I believed her. I fell "
"asleep that night convinced she truly understood and that there would be no more problems."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ero allibita. ⟪k:2⟫Come poteva la madre di una santa dire certe cose? ⟪k:3⟫Aiutare la "
"gente era la mia vocazione—⟪k:4⟫e lei si aspettava una ⟪k:5⟫ricompensa⟪k:6⟫?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Mi "
"veniva da piangere, vedendo mia madre presa da tali desideri terreni.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Così "
"cercai di farle capire quanto fosse importante il mio compito. ⟪k:14⟫Le spiegai che non dovevamo "
"desiderare la ricchezza materiale, bensì dedicare le nostre vite al servizio del prossimo.⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“Hai ragione, mia cara santa”, disse, comprensiva.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫E io le credetti. "
"Quella notte mi addormentai convinta che lei avesse capito davvero, e che non ci sarebbero stati "
"altri problemi."

#: search2:search2_28E35D2F_DBEC_4F37_B683_34DDBD18D58B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ea37f1b6358b113cd50d9b401dfcd1e4c095145e75c6f5466dee9db6bf9668b
#. default-sha256: 8d98b62bc83ba6c8c94ac6abc0d439eda9bcc2c400f10ea6b96b86d5863dcd74
msgctxt "search2:search2_28E35D2F_DBEC_4F37_B683_34DDBD18D58B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I decided it was a trial.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫My Father, the Lord God, was testing my "
"worthiness of being⟪k:5⟫His daughter. ⟪k:6⟫So I choked back my urge to cry and sat there in "
"silent contemplation.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫For almost three weeks was I rocked around in the "
"carriage.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The coachman treated me well enough, but I’m certain it was only because he "
"didn’t want his precious cargo dying before he could⟪k:13⟫deliver it. ⟪k:14⟫He did not, by any "
"means, think me the child of God."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Decisi di credere che fosse una prova.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Mio Padre, il Signore Dio, stava "
"verificando che fossi meritevole⟪k:5⟫di essere Sua figlia. ⟪k:6⟫Così frenai il mio bisogno di "
"piangere e me ne stetti lì, meditando in silenzio.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Fui cullata dal carro per "
"quasi tre settimane.⟪k:11⟫ Il cocchiere mi trattava abbastanza bene, ma sono sicura fosse solo "
"perché non voleva che la sua preziosa merce morisse prima che fosse riuscito a consegnarla.⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫Non mi considerava affatto la figlia di Dio."

#: search2:search2_406D943E_A177_4E51_A89A_1E6647B3CCB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0eed5782b5e07d7426cd0754b97d3c0ca30f1cab8f0c6317bd7fb54ef24df967
#. default-sha256: 0a5496c3112b328fa93ecf781159e43a24636a561ec1f17c286a41eafe4f1f8a
msgctxt "search2:search2_406D943E_A177_4E51_A89A_1E6647B3CCB7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Welcome, daughter of God.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You’ll be performing miracles for me now.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Benvenuta, figlia di Dio.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫D’ora in poi eseguirai miracoli per me.”"

#: search2:search2_5E3A5AA6_16B8_479F_A263_8C4A5CA62EF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5516c7de4ed12ebcfd6b2d2f7b24d09b6a3c90fbe66187db33e5ec182016274b
#. default-sha256: 0b15d85907ec372e82eaa7928c1dced581280737a8eecdfd629be5ad45b50c13
msgctxt "search2:search2_5E3A5AA6_16B8_479F_A263_8C4A5CA62EF8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Miracles are not something to be performed for one single person’s benefit,” ⟪k:2⟫I "
"replied, shocked and furious he had just said something so utterly blasphemous.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫In "
"response, he said, “I ⟪k:6⟫bought⟪k:7⟫ you. You are my property. You have no right to an "
"opinion.”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫But I would not have any of it. I entreated him to give up his indulgent "
"lifestyle and devote himself to the service of the Lord.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫But the more I "
"pleaded, the deeper the creases on his face grew.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Thinking back on it now, it "
"was hardly surprising. ⟪k:18⟫A nine-year-old girl was scolding the most powerful man in the "
"region. ⟪k:19⟫I believed it was my duty, and that I was only doing what was right, but he surely "
"saw it as incredible arrogance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“I miracoli non sono qualcosa da compiere per l’interesse di una sola persona”, ⟪k:2⟫"
"risposi, scioccata e furiosa, dopo aver sentito qualcosa di così enormemente blasfemo.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫Lui ribattè, dicendo, “Ti ho ⟪k:6⟫comprata⟪k:7⟫. Sei di mia proprietà. Non hai diritto ad "
"avere un’opinione”.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Ma io non ne volevo sapere. Lo esortai a rinunciare al suo "
"stile di vita sregolato e a dedicare se stesso al servizio del Signore.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Ma "
"più supplicavo, più le pieghe sul suo viso si facevano profonde.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Ripensandoci "
"adesso, non avrebbe dovuto sorprendermi.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Una bambina di nove anni che rimproverava "
"l’uomo più potente della regione... ⟪k:20⟫Credevo fosse mio dovere, e che stessi solo facendo ciò "
"che era giusto, ma lui lo vide di certo come un gesto incredibilmente arrogante."

#: search2:search2_1A678B86_7D11_4FDA_844C_469738277C30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95ab140db9eff436674bc52dcbbb67c2e4c2ce8cd4cc8cc725e643202fb08f21
#. default-sha256: ff225ee623d8d8f764552af03dfa7175288e77c2b9e55d24767df8b061aacc42
msgctxt "search2:search2_1A678B86_7D11_4FDA_844C_469738277C30"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“A saint’s blood and good fortune to all!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Brindiamo!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Al sangue della santa e alla nostra prosperità!”"

#: search2:search2_17960355_07F9_4DB3_8BAE_2E363F7AEE82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc981f906063cc8ee64614634208ace5815361ed96ddd58fef42b44a2e68ee88
#. default-sha256: e477e3dfabffa9392efb5dfa257bb6740ec14037a5a326c4f0ff7f504ad4823b
msgctxt "search2:search2_17960355_07F9_4DB3_8BAE_2E363F7AEE82"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫That was when I realized, ⟪k:6⟫the lord was only interested in the "
"approval of others. ⟪k:7⟫He reveled in their envy as he pranced about, showing off his curious "
"new toy—⟪k:8⟫me.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫He didn’t need my miracles.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Neither he, nor any "
"of his guests were afflicted with disease or misfortune. ⟪k:15⟫They were all richly blessed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Fu allora che capii; ⟪k:6⟫il lord era interessato solo "
"all’approvazione degli altri. ⟪k:7⟫Gioiva della loro invidia mentre camminava impettito, "
"mostrando il suo nuovo insolito giocattolo—⟪k:8⟫me.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Non aveva bisogno dei miei "
"miracoli.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Né lui né i suoi ospiti erano afflitti da malattie o sventure. ⟪k:15⟫"
"Erano tutti ampiamente fortunati."

#: search2:search2_392C0EAA_FE9E_45BB_9F37_E954A3C2F803
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3f25dae3dd0f142a5b61ecbeca5b1100ee2f75e206a077799aca2db5236985e
#. default-sha256: 96b1f36f59483668aa12154f470aef00d901f9c020f9bd253b00389586b4944f
msgctxt "search2:search2_392C0EAA_FE9E_45BB_9F37_E954A3C2F803"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫For a while, I was convinced it was all God’s test.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That it was part of "
"His plan for me, His daughter.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫That if I could make it through this trial, I would "
"be allowed to go back to helping people.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫That man would celebrate my success. Envy "
"me. Worship me.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫That sinners would face punishment.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫That divine "
"retribution would be delivered unto all who had wronged me, a saint.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫With "
"each passing day, my spirit grew more twisted."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Per del tempo, rimasi convinta che fosse tutta una prova di Dio.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Che "
"fosse parte del piano che aveva in serbo per me, Sua figlia.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Che se fossi riuscita "
"a superare quell’esame, sarei potuta tornare ad aiutare la gente.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Che gli uomini "
"avrebbero celebrato il mio successo. Che mi avrebbero invidiata. Venerata.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Che i "
"peccatori avrebbero affrontato la loro pena.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Che il castigo divino sarebbe stato "
"inflitto a tutti coloro che mi avrebbero oltraggiata.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Col passare dei "
"giorni, il mio spirito si faceva sempre più instabile."

#: search2:search2_BF09B8E4_2AFD_44B8_B239_F40919211AA7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 318d54634603302e2fa6824c2a089be039307059cd5f486c6a6d689648511efd
#. default-sha256: eaa10ddfbfb44b48ace5b3fdd46cc5069c30d8eac451c157a36e9fcbf6588edb
msgctxt "search2:search2_BF09B8E4_2AFD_44B8_B239_F40919211AA7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Would anyone have believed that scarred and bloodied girl tied up on the floor in the "
"banquet hall was a ⟪k:2⟫saint⟪k:3⟫? ⟪k:4⟫Unlikely. This was no charitable gathering, but an "
"unholy sabbat.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Perhaps it was caused by my corrupted spirit. ⟪k:9⟫Perhaps it "
"was my heart’s way of crying for help. ⟪k:10⟫Or perhaps it was the Devil giving me my witch’s "
"mark. ⟪k:11⟫But no matter what the cause, during one of the bloody banquets, I underwent a "
"transformation.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫I was half-conscious, as usual, when one of the guests pointed "
"at me and shouted something. ⟪k:15⟫His face went pale, as if he were afraid, which I found quite "
"curious. ⟪k:16⟫The lord then approached me, grabbing me by the hair and lifting my head. ⟪k:17⟫He "
"yelled something, but I was too far gone to be able to make out what he was saying."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Qualcuno avrebbe seriamente creduto che quella ragazza sfregiata e insanguinata, legata "
"sul pavimento nella sala del banchetto, fosse una ⟪k:2⟫santa⟪k:3⟫? ⟪k:4⟫Improbabile. Quello non "
"era un incontro di beneficienza, ma un rito profano.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Forse fu a causa del mio "
"spirito corrotto. ⟪k:9⟫Forse era il modo in cui⟪k:10⟫il mio cuore gridava aiuto. ⟪k:11⟫O forse "
"era il Diavolo che mi stava dando⟪k:12⟫il marchio della strega. ⟪k:13⟫Ma qualunque fosse la "
"causa, durante uno di quegli spietati banchetti, subii una trasformazione.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Ero "
"semicosciente, come al solito, quando uno degli invitati puntò il dito verso di me, gridando "
"qualcosa. ⟪k:17⟫Il suo volto era pallido, come se avesse paura, il che mi sembrò alquanto strano. "
"⟪k:18⟫E poi, il lord si avvicinò a me, afferrandomi per i capelli e sollevandomi la testa. ⟪k:19⟫"
"Urlò qualcosa, ma ero andata troppo oltre per riuscire a capire cosa stesse dicendo."

#: search2:search2_C3A74CDE_C593_47E5_85D2_8597EA077908
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a2720d8ee228b063217eeefb9492bf45babf5bc2d826f56e6e19f7f7c0ecc14
#. default-sha256: e5258a76812e4e50fb0b75dd13168e981d2d6ac27ddec6140a8a9541814cb83c
msgctxt "search2:search2_C3A74CDE_C593_47E5_85D2_8597EA077908"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“You’re a damned witch wearing a saint’s skin!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Sei solo una dannata strega travestita da santa!”"

#: search2:search2_16F47D88_4BCD_468F_8FE9_489758DEDEC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 891de6ef583a843bf088905dd0d8b191e595e8b15c51c96c47ebad7ca09d4ce3
#. default-sha256: 664f694bde9cf835f6330c64f647e93d5f2cd4c128eee23d19e6a564f76d1711
msgctxt "search2:search2_16F47D88_4BCD_468F_8FE9_489758DEDEC8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫Without warning,"
msgstr ""
