#: search2:search2_9FC511EB_2983_49FF_96C9_3B45F0C94B09
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac8d8edbcd2dfe14f75b3b14acfe9474d8a36ddee419125862f8f2bc02cd3ad9
#. default-sha256: dc87e0617428c696b5a7eb91ec58c3e670ad1d8524940f1e6be5e4c4bddcc07d
msgctxt "search2:search2_9FC511EB_2983_49FF_96C9_3B45F0C94B09"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫“You’re a damned witch wearing a saint’s skin!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫“Sei "
"solo una dannata strega travestita da santa!”"

#: search2:search2_B5C94E70_7F00_4F2E_9FF5_97F840DD1E68
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68ed76fa70f8625618484731a59b9f77e5dd31418c7bf3e0bf32c74112b24d78
#. default-sha256: 130ad4c7638f121671ad0be0809041faade076fd59dabac2f4941cf9df17df0b
msgctxt "search2:search2_B5C94E70_7F00_4F2E_9FF5_97F840DD1E68"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Maybe if I ⟪k:2⟫had⟪k:3⟫ died then, ⟪k:4⟫I wouldn’t have become the witch you know now. "
"⟪k:5⟫But that’s all conjecture.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Theorizing about what ⟪k:9⟫could⟪k:10⟫ have "
"happened is an exercise in futility."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Probabilmente ⟪k:2⟫se fossi⟪k:3⟫ morta allora, ⟪k:4⟫non sarei diventata la strega che "
"conosci oggi. ⟪k:5⟫Ma la mia è solo un’ipotesi.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Muovere supposizioni su cosa ⟪k:9⟫"
"sarebbe⟪k:10⟫ potuto accadere è un’attività futile."

#: search2:search2_A2B20511_D010_4E29_89C3_F2263B0A6C77
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b2fe358963b399079d04d44b310a5930d06088791019e50f82e8d6819f77aee
#. default-sha256: 6cd637647cca1ce2b9b12b45fa38ab3b67cdfa0c871eeaa755731e17c9e9a861
msgctxt "search2:search2_A2B20511_D010_4E29_89C3_F2263B0A6C77"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But no, I did not die that day.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Brought together by constant "
"mistreatment, the lord’s slaves chose that moment to start their revolt. ⟪k:5⟫When he swung down "
"his blade, someone bumped into him and it was knocked off its course.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I didn’t "
"have the strength to get to my feet, so I simply watched the chaos unfold before my hazy eyes. "
"⟪k:10⟫It never even occurred to me that I should try to escape.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫At some "
"point during the riot, a young man—one of the slaves—grabbed me by my bloody, limp arm and led me "
"out of the lord’s manor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ad ogni modo...⟪k:2⟫ no, non sono morta quel giorno.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Uniti per via del "
"costante abuso subìto, gli schiavi del lord avevano scelto proprio quel momento per dare inizio "
"alla loro insurrezione. ⟪k:6⟫Mentre egli sferrava il suo fendente, qualcuno gli sbatté contro,"
"⟪k:7⟫e la spada balzò via dalla propria traiettoria.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Non avevo la forza di "
"alzarmi in piedi, perciò mi limitai ad assistere al caos che imperversava davanti ai miei occhi "
"offuscati. ⟪k:12⟫Non avevo nemmeno pensato che avrei dovuto tentare la fuga.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Ad un certo punto durante la rivolta, un ragazzo—⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫uno degli schiavi—⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫"
"afferrò il mio braccio fiacco e insanguinato, e mi condusse via dalla tenuta del lord."

#: search2:search2_3785C6ED_3C88_4502_9EEE_CA220C2BA32E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc4186bd5ab21c020ff8783c673bbc9243b1ce3782a87401db3e520e93f699b6
#. default-sha256: 88649e8d3127397446b71d910797f537be9b6165f90ec6e21cc6671f30b68759
msgctxt "search2:search2_3785C6ED_3C88_4502_9EEE_CA220C2BA32E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The young man brought me to a slum—a place where the people banded together in their "
"hardship, barely scraping together enough to eat every day, let alone pay the taxes demanded of "
"them.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫By the time we had arrived at a small brothel located a ways into the slum, "
"the fog was starting to clear from my mind. ⟪k:5⟫I knew where we were, and feeling the gazes of "
"those scantily clothed women, I trembled.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫In a sense, that was possibly the "
"most frightened I had ever been in my life—despite everything else I had been through. ⟪k:10⟫The "
"idea that I had fallen so far I would have to become a prostitute scared me to death."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il giovane mi portò nei bassifondi di una città—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫un posto dove le persone si "
"univano per far fronte alle avversità, racimolando a fatica ciò che serviva per riuscire a "
"mangiare ogni giorno, senza contare le tasse che venivano imposte loro.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Nel momento "
"in cui fummo arrivati in un piccolo bordello situato all’interno di un quartiere malfamato, la "
"nebbia che avvolgeva la mia mente cominciò a diradarsi. ⟪k:7⟫Sapevo dove eravamo, e alla vista di "
"quelle donne vestite in modo succinto che mi osservavano, tremai.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫In un "
"certo senso, quello fu probabilmente il momento in cui ho avuto più paura in vita mia—⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"nonostante tutto ciò che avevo passato.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Il pensiero di essere caduta così in basso da "
"diventare una prostituta⟪k:16⟫mi terrorizzava a morte."

#: search2:search2_6853B0A8_FB9D_4D4F_9722_B38286C2B0CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 785ed6721cb2730c20f789648accb81a63bf30c6336801489103a9782b1c8fd6
#. default-sha256: ccdc2982f81a51f1f0781c79d7464acf9a9bf999792790ed411dd65d40af0f73
msgctxt "search2:search2_6853B0A8_FB9D_4D4F_9722_B38286C2B0CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He said he knew someone here—someone I could trust—and that she would give me a room. "
"⟪k:2⟫I had trouble believing him, though.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I couldn’t trust the word of a prostitute—⟪k:5⟫"
"someone who valued money more than her own body.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫It was all a trap, I was "
"sure. ⟪k:10⟫One day, they would tell me I had to work. ⟪k:11⟫Nothing he said would convince me "
"otherwise.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Apparently sensing my mistrust, the slave gave me an apologetic frown "
"and handed me a mirror, saying, “Even if I did, you couldn’t get any work looking like that.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Disse che conosceva qualcuna lì—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫qualcuna di cui potevo fidarmi—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"e che mi avrebbe dato una stanza. ⟪k:7⟫Ma facevo fatica a credergli.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Non potevo fidarmi "
"della parola di una prostituta—⟪k:10⟫una che dava più valore al denaro che al proprio corpo.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Era tutta una trappola, ne ero sicura. ⟪k:15⟫Un giorno, mi avrebbero detto che "
"avrei dovuto lavorare. ⟪k:16⟫Niente di quello che lui diceva avrebbe potuto convincermi del "
"contrario.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Avvertendo la mia diffidenza, lo schiavo fece un’espressione "
"dispiaciuta e mi porse uno specchio, dicendo, “Anche se fosse, non saresti riuscita a lavorare, "
"conciata così.”"

#: search2:search2_33D52413_72C8_4B0A_975E_AB0831FF8C46
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3bf3a7592ef1bd03d842694c65a0c7d9666f8a78ed7cf26c770d24d8bc723259
#. default-sha256: 12d2a9aae5d65fe428ce0866c77291bb206158efb817ea4d2ddeca20f9156c13
msgctxt "search2:search2_33D52413_72C8_4B0A_975E_AB0831FF8C46"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I could not believe what I saw.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That couldn’t be my face.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"It had to be an illusion.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫There was no way.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫That was not the face "
"of a saint.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫It ⟪k:17⟫couldn’t⟪k:18⟫ be.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫It wasn’t real—it "
"wasn’t possible."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non riuscivo a credere a ciò che vedevo.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Quella non poteva essere la mia "
"faccia.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Doveva essere un’illusione.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Impossibile...⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"Quello non era il volto di una santa.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Non poteva⟪k:18⟫ esserlo.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫"
"⟪k:21⟫Non era reale—⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫non era possibile."

#: search2:search2_5FFAA84C_624C_43B0_8861_5ECBC3D23228
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a00b439b8a520123318b1c8643d35f575c5c60e977377b4bc744513005c355a9
#. default-sha256: cf87cdd260c344241b49a13be09e16280bcb5a606c448e0c3099806f3c6d4df1
msgctxt "search2:search2_5FFAA84C_624C_43B0_8861_5ECBC3D23228"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Patches of skin had fallen off my face, exposing the raw, red flesh beneath. ⟪k:2⟫It "
"looked quite similar to what had been done to my arms and legs, ⟪k:3⟫except my face had never "
"been cut before.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Looking at myself in the mirror, even ⟪k:8⟫I⟪k:9⟫ doubted my "
"own sainthood. ⟪k:10⟫The thing in my reflection was a hellish abomination. ⟪k:11⟫It was the "
"twisted face of a witch.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫And although I was shocked by what I saw, at the same "
"time, it answered several lingering questions. ⟪k:15⟫It explained why the lord and his guests had "
"panicked at the sight of me, ⟪k:16⟫and it also explained why he had said I was “a witch wearing a "
"saint’s skin.”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Over the course of the dozens of banquets I had participated in, "
"my face must have mutated.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Twisted into this ugly, ⟪k:24⟫sickening, ⟪k:25⟫"
"monstrous thing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Chiazze di pelle erano cadute dal mio viso, esponendo la carne rossa e viva "
"sottostante. ⟪k:2⟫Era molto simile a ciò che era stato fatto alle mie braccia e alle mie gambe, "
"⟪k:3⟫con l’eccezione che il mio viso non era mai stato tagliato prima.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"Guardandomi allo specchio, persino ⟪k:8⟫io⟪k:9⟫ dubitai della mia santità.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ciò che "
"vedevo nel mio riflesso era un abominio infernale. ⟪k:12⟫Era il volto contorto di una strega."
"⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫E sebbene fossi scioccata da quello che stavo vedendo, allo stesso tempo, "
"rispose a diverse domande in sospeso. ⟪k:16⟫Chiarì il motivo per cui⟪k:17⟫il lord e i suoi ospiti "
"erano rimasti terrorizzati alla mia vista, ⟪k:18⟫spiegando anche come mai lui aveva detto che ero "
"“una strega travestita da santa.”⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Nel corso dei numerosi banchetti a cui avevo "
"partecipato, il mio viso doveva essere mutato.⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫Trasformandomi in un "
"orrendo mostro rivoltante."

#: search2:search2_42A499D1_7C1A_4176_BF13_E2A609DFF67B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 74f8f9cd154f994aca312e7400b6191a41b680b7374d6bf621f04517e7728abd
#. default-sha256: bc752d9a8eae1d4af6ac6e3eae470cb6de0b038864ef5ef506be41e6345c6a83
msgctxt "search2:search2_42A499D1_7C1A_4176_BF13_E2A609DFF67B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The sight of what I had become sapped the last bit of willpower from me.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Not because I was particularly fond of my face or thought myself especially beautiful, ⟪k:5⟫but "
"because it crushed me to see everything “saintly” about me crumble away. ⟪k:6⟫Test from God or "
"otherwise, I didn’t have the strength left to attempt to overcome it.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Deciding I "
"would rather be dead than struggle any longer, I begged the slave to kill me. ⟪k:10⟫Taking one’s "
"own life was a sin; if I did that, I would not be able to return to my Father’s side, and I "
"wanted to ask Him why I had been put through such tribulation.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫But the "
"young man refused. ⟪k:15⟫He said, completely missing my intention, that if I persevered, good "
"fortune would eventually find me. He said that if I lived on, I would eventually have a chance to "
"get my payback.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫I had no such worldly concerns, though, but if no one would take "
"my life, I had no choice but to live."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vedere ciò che ero diventata mi privò dell’ultimo brandello di volontà che mi era "
"rimasto.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Non perché amassi il mio viso in modo particolare o perché mi considerassi "
"bella, ⟪k:5⟫ma perché mi distrusse vedere come tutto ciò che avevo di “sacro” fosse scomparso. "
"⟪k:6⟫Che fosse una prova di Dio o meno, non avevo più la forza per cercare di superare la cosa."
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Decidendo che avrei preferito morire piuttosto che lottare oltre, supplicai lo "
"schiavo di uccidermi. ⟪k:10⟫Togliersi la vita era peccato; se l’avessi fatto, non sarei stata in "
"grado di riunirmi al fianco di mio Padre, né di chiedergli perché fossi stata sottoposta ad una "
"tale sofferenza.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Ma il giovane si rifiutò. ⟪k:15⟫Disse, travisando del "
"tutto le mie intenzioni, che se avessi perseverato, la fortuna mi avrebbe trovata. Disse che se "
"avessi continuato a vivere, prima o poi avrei avuto la mia rivincita.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Non avevo "
"tali interessi terreni, ma se nessuno mi avrebbe tolto la vita, non potevo far altro che "
"continuare a vivere."

#: search2:search2_3C2FC324_5E07_4C60_991E_F7B8CC62B4D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd67869096eed791773fafcd7e814917d87cf641343dc286cb68d166e8a0fe21
#. default-sha256: ac8a54564f976ec71f5b5c3ee6d1bc58f6bd292cad878212aa6be7d467e90ca8
msgctxt "search2:search2_3C2FC324_5E07_4C60_991E_F7B8CC62B4D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Occasionally, the slave would drop in to check on me. ⟪k:2⟫The other men thought me "
"ghastly and wouldn’t get anywhere near me, but he was different. ⟪k:3⟫And every time he visited, "
"he would say, “One day, I’ll show you the world.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫And to tell you the truth, "
"⟪k:8⟫I was beginning to grow attached to it all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A volte, lo schiavo veniva a trovarmi per vedere come stavo.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Gli altri uomini "
"mi ritenevano terrificante e non si sarebbero mai avvicinati a me, ma lui era diverso. ⟪k:4⟫E "
"ogni volta che passava, mi diceva,⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“Un giorno, ti mostrerò il mondo.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫E a dirti la verità, ⟪k:11⟫stavo cominciando ad abituarmi all’idea."

#: search2:search2_1BC39E90_242B_47AE_ACBD_10120B407D12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32330e9826bd8ddd082b4f01b722356e5717ed2c8041adecf473c1c44015ccd5
#. default-sha256: f0f7d25004e5e60bef4f52646ab92ec0ffd82f175c72adffdd3faeb01f6adad0
msgctxt "search2:search2_1BC39E90_242B_47AE_ACBD_10120B407D12"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Perhaps I ⟪k:2⟫could⟪k:3⟫ perform miracles, ⟪k:4⟫but that didn’t necessarily mean I had "
"to be the daughter of God or a saint. ⟪k:5⟫Maybe I was just a regular person... ⟪k:6⟫who happened "
"to possess some unusual abilities.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Ridiculous, isn’t it? ⟪k:11⟫Despite coming "
"to accept my humanity, I refused to let go of my miraculous powers. ⟪k:12⟫They were the last "
"thing protecting what I thought of as “myself.”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫But to me at the time, it felt "
"like a very dramatic change of heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Potevo anche compiere miracoli, ⟪k:2⟫ma ciò non significava necessariamente che dovevo "
"essere la figlia di Dio o una santa.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Forse ero soltanto una persona qualunque... ⟪k:5⟫"
"che per caso si era ritrovata con delle abilità insolite.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Assurdo, eh? ⟪k:10⟫"
"Nonostante fossi arrivata ad accettare la mia umanità, mi rifiutavo di rinunciare ai miei poteri "
"miracolosi. ⟪k:11⟫Erano l’ultima cosa rimasta a proteggere ciò che consideravo “me stessa”.⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Ma all’epoca quello mi sembrò un cambiamento piuttosto drastico."

#: search2:search2_7B446C25_542C_4B30_B77A_C31F37847906
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61ad812cb205bc5cc9a09cafc45c8d9ad93678d762be5b95164b5f94efe8aeac
#. default-sha256: 82c35c6f4550e5e0fdefc3960b460ed4e3dd5b9af1916be118468b6b7e04ae3b
msgctxt "search2:search2_7B446C25_542C_4B30_B77A_C31F37847906"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Three years after the revolt at the lord’s manor, I had my twelfth birthday, for which "
"they threw me a little dinner party. ⟪k:2⟫The women all pitched in to bake me treats, and the "
"young slave man was there too.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I was happy. ⟪k:7⟫I thought that if life could "
"continue on like this, I was fine with not going back to being a saint."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tre anni dopo la rivolta alla tenuta del lord, compii il mio dodicesimo compleanno, per "
"il quale organizzarono una piccola festa. ⟪k:2⟫Le donne si diedero da fare per prepararmi dei "
"dolci, e insieme a loro c’era anche il giovane schiavo.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ero felice. ⟪k:7⟫"
"Pensai che se la vita fosse continuata così, mi sarebbe stato bene non tornare ad essere una "
"santa."

#: search2:search2_F2E1F7D1_5100_44A1_858B_66767D4E66C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 339446a26e345c49b7c80d08070b4f3caf2dc956ce828332622bdb4a11198848
#. default-sha256: 5fa843e4ff42dde224ff97aea269d2c100d0cba466a22d01a9054cb8a4668ada
msgctxt "search2:search2_F2E1F7D1_5100_44A1_858B_66767D4E66C4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Let me tell you what happened that night.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫On the night of my birthday "
"celebration, bandits attacked the brothel. ⟪k:5⟫Now, bandits were hardly a rarity in that time, "
"so everyone was always on the lookout, and we never went out at night. ⟪k:6⟫They wouldn’t stop at "
"robbing you either; ⟪k:7⟫they were armed with blades and would frequently kill their targets if "
"necessary.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫But cautious as we were, we were helpless against a direct raid.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫The brothel fell into a panic, screams echoing in the night."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Lascia che ti racconti cosa accadde quella notte.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Durante la notte dei "
"festeggiamenti per il mio compleanno, i banditi attaccarono il bordello. ⟪k:5⟫Insomma, i banditi "
"non erano una rarità a quei tempi, dunque stavamo sempre tutti in guardia, e non uscivamo mai di "
"notte. ⟪k:6⟫Non si sarebbero nemmeno limitati a derubarti; ⟪k:7⟫erano armati di spade, e spesso "
"uccidevano i loro bersagli, se necessario.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Tuttavia, per quanto fossimo cauti, "
"eravamo indifesi contro un assalto diretto.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Il bordello cadde nel panico, e le "
"urla echeggiarono nella notte."

#: search2:search2_C0277943_3A04_4B04_9E30_551311929631
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bdece07b1277de95fc5a22669cae1b3e56d665f230b783ee815b492c9803699
#. default-sha256: d334182aa519627af3507dc2dfbf28e4e271e8d7e7e7a4a541da7dfba34df6ea
msgctxt "search2:search2_C0277943_3A04_4B04_9E30_551311929631"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The customers were carved up and left for dead.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The women were bound and "
"stowed away to be sold.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫My peaceful world shattered in an instant.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"And the next thing I knew, I was some slave trader’s merchandise."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I clienti furono straziati e lasciati a morire.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Le donne furono legate e "
"rapite per essere vendute.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Il mio mondo pacifico venne demolito in un istante.⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫E prima che potessi rendermene conto, ero diventata merce di un trafficante di schiavi."

#: search2:search2_847C87FC_1F7A_4271_A04C_1F8DEA58AAE0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de7a05975aca46033225cd1faae3e94bba4a46a0c801401c4997801d6bc3610d
#. default-sha256: f91b7b5e1b2b60f15f92c3f831953feace4f168e7d0cd9457342010fd71a4573
msgctxt "search2:search2_847C87FC_1F7A_4271_A04C_1F8DEA58AAE0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I don’t know what became of the prostitutes who cared for me or the slave who brought "
"me to them. ⟪k:2⟫I assume the women were sold and the young man slaughtered. ⟪k:3⟫But regardless, "
"I found myself being rocked around in the back of a carriage once more."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non so che fine avessero fatto le prostitute che si occupavano di me o lo schiavo che "
"mi aveva portata da loro. ⟪k:2⟫Immagino che le donne fossero state vendute e il giovane "
"massacrato. ⟪k:3⟫In ogni caso, mi ritrovai sballottata nel retro di un carro ancora una volta."

#: search2:search2_E6D58E53_F994_413A_A105_5D8EBF5414D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66a5200b47acff8e2736d5e77f58cd0d40b5d1b714f74c904fe9a98a767feafb
