msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ma vorrei non averle mai provate."

#: search2:search2_6828E224_0986_4005_83AF_F218D0C220AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36db1bb8d166b4eac8255bb37eca0add791dc4e4b44d84debd1cfbe8763b348f
#. default-sha256: c0dd30b68ba9c36c75a9f91f6af7081a069aa4eb892ad45f2eeee0538572af8d
msgctxt "search2:search2_6828E224_0986_4005_83AF_F218D0C220AC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫then I doubt I would have felt so much terror at the sight of death."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫dubito che avrei provato così tanto terrore alla vista della morte."

