#: search2:search2_7D97F3A4_2106_4FC1_9AB7_B7A82DF8D047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4b4c93e670bb43de2acda846675424faf8b17d3dc33c9108ab6f62def195c2e
#. default-sha256: 1bcc6e58c9d7f0ec734e338074a862584c76306c0b5c424884bf980870b640c0
msgctxt "search2:search2_7D97F3A4_2106_4FC1_9AB7_B7A82DF8D047"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The woman was a witch—⟪k:2⟫by trade, that is.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It appeared she had had a "
"deep knowledge of medicinal herbs, using it to make an assortment of medicines. ⟪k:6⟫In her "
"cabinets were dozens of small glass bottles containing dried, powdered leaves, and crushed "
"berries, among other things. ⟪k:7⟫On the fire was a cauldron, liquid bubbling inside.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The woman looked as though she was asleep. ⟪k:12⟫Presumably, she had passed away of "
"old age, for there was no sign bandits had been rooting through the cottage, and she had a look "
"of absolute serenity on her face.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Looking over at the woman’s dead body, I "
"didn’t cross myself.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I envied her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫La donna era una strega—⟪k:2⟫di professione, s’intende.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Sembrava che "
"avesse una grande conoscenza delle erbe medicinali, usate per creare un vasto assortimento di "
"farmaci. ⟪k:6⟫Nei suoi armadi teneva decine di piccole bottiglie di vetro contenenti foglie in "
"polvere, foglie essiccate e bacche macinate, insieme ad altre cose. ⟪k:7⟫Sul fuoco c’era un "
"calderone, con del liquido ribollente al suo interno.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Sembrava come se la "
"donna stesse dormendo. ⟪k:12⟫Era presumibilmente morta di vecchiaia, non essendoci alcuna traccia "
"di banditi che avessero setacciato la casa, e aveva sul volto un’espressione di assoluta serenità."
"⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Guardando il cadavere della donna, non mi feci il segno della croce.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"La invidiavo."

#: search2:search2_0A1E4F6B_9D14_401F_8E11_E461B7C25250
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc3c488c9b1587151089054ef8dc8110852136cbf098a5705a0f8f945d02ebe5
#. default-sha256: 992de1db05fc682b274820cce75f39079e1204206d9a1c1b4c33e5180369d960
msgctxt "search2:search2_0A1E4F6B_9D14_401F_8E11_E461B7C25250"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“My sister has fallen very ill, and she desperately needs medicine.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Mia sorella è molto malata,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫e ha un disperato bisogno di medicine.”"

#: search2:search2_5C1F80B5_C353_4B86_A024_558C35E11706
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26414480305466ec501547ba396af3b929fcce84d9c53b291c61ee95e0d0c9fb
#. default-sha256: 1633da04f62f154baf2265772e7f11caf0bbc3cca6259fedba429abaca2ebdb9
msgctxt "search2:search2_5C1F80B5_C353_4B86_A024_558C35E11706"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫According to him, his younger sister had fallen gravely ill, and though they had tried "
"a number of remedies, she was still bedridden. ⟪k:2⟫The medicines I gave him too had no effect, "
"but he persisted in his quest, visiting me again and again for new combinations to try.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫He wanted nothing more than to relieve even the slightest bit of his sister’s suffering. "
"⟪k:6⟫And, moved by his dedication to his family, I too wanted to do anything I could to help.⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫For the first time in years, my world encompassed more than my small cottage."
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫When the young man came, he would ask not only for medicine—but to go on "
"walks with me. ⟪k:15⟫He ⟪k:16⟫volunteered⟪k:17⟫ to spend time with me, despite my horrifying "
"appearance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A quanto diceva, sua sorella minore si era ammalata gravemente,⟪k:2⟫e sebbene avessero "
"provato vari rimedi, era ancora costretta a letto. ⟪k:3⟫Anche le medicine che gli avevo dato non "
"ebbero alcun effetto, ma lui continuò nella sua ricerca, venendo a trovarmi ancora e ancora per "
"provare altre combinazioni.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Non voleva nient’altro che alleviare, anche se di poco, "
"le sofferenze della sorella. ⟪k:7⟫E anch’io, spinta dalla sua devozione verso la propria "
"famiglia, volevo fare tutto il possibile per aiutarli.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Per la prima volta "
"dopo anni, il mio mondo comprendeva qualcos’altro che non fosse la mia piccola dimora.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Quando il giovane si ripresentò, mi chiese non solo le medicine—⟪k:16⟫ma anche di "
"passeggiare insieme a me. ⟪k:17⟫Si era ⟪k:18⟫offerto⟪k:19⟫ di trascorrere del tempo con me, "
"malgrado il mio aspetto orripilante."

#: search2:search2_244B3A92_0001_4CC4_831E_B498831F882E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9479e49e63417215f4b18f34d29f049ef4792108d778b0510bdf747573118ebd
#. default-sha256: c35e206a3fa2f763d80bcb7c623a6158ded0e2ffd3bc698b37b70c70def9df4a
msgctxt "search2:search2_244B3A92_0001_4CC4_831E_B498831F882E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“It’s not healthy to stay holed up inside all the time.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Non fa bene starsene chiusi dentro tutto il tempo.”"

#: search2:search2_9F3D9F63_11CC_4A4B_AA1E_D8F0FFB4222A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34ecaf692d93e93bc84e43ba465efdc6dcb29fb5097d68c9fe73b5db626636ac
#. default-sha256: 030d47fa04984bda3df14f945fd8e5b586b9592a25604614c279f24b76550e2b
msgctxt "search2:search2_9F3D9F63_11CC_4A4B_AA1E_D8F0FFB4222A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“You’ve got this beautiful lake right here.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫What do you say we take a "
"little walk around the shoreline?”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Hai questo splendido lago proprio qua fuori.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Che ne dici di fare una "
"passeggiata attorno alla riva?”"

#: search2:search2_9FDE4F87_C30E_4ECA_85BE_22AEB9159F14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37a514656100d9fb2336368daebad51b2b5f18a2da2e804bf1ed925f3c376adc
#. default-sha256: 110b2236939881a08d30c9bbe58a2f0a0b2f14d9b432a060d32be1a14ffcfea4
msgctxt "search2:search2_9FDE4F87_C30E_4ECA_85BE_22AEB9159F14"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He said with a smile, taking me by the hand.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We spoke as we circled the "
"lakeside. ⟪k:5⟫His voice was always soft and pleasant—like a ray of light shining through a crack "
"in the walls. ⟪k:6⟫When I was with him, I felt like I could be an actual ⟪k:7⟫person⟪k:8⟫. An "
"ordinary girl.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫He talked about his sister more than anything. ⟪k:13⟫And "
"whenever he did, he was at his brightest—and most melancholy.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫The young man had "
"been a member of a noble house, but disputes over who was the rightful heir had forced him and "
"his sister out. ⟪k:17⟫Shortly after that, his sister had fallen ill and was now bedridden."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Disse con un sorriso, prendendomi per mano.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Mentre giravamo attorno al "
"lago, chiacchieravamo. ⟪k:5⟫La sua voce era sempre delicata e piacevole—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫come un raggio "
"di luce che splende attraverso una crepa nel muro. ⟪k:8⟫Quando ero insieme a lui, mi sentivo come "
"se potessi essere una ⟪k:9⟫persona vera⟪k:10⟫. Una ragazza qualunque.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"Discuteva di sua sorella più di tutto il resto. ⟪k:15⟫E ogni volta che ne parlava, era quanto più "
"raggiante—e malinconico—potesse essere.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Il giovane era stato membro di una "
"famiglia nobile, ma le dispute su chi fosse l’erede legittimo avevano costretto i due fratelli ad "
"andarsene. ⟪k:19⟫Poco dopo, sua sorella si era ammalata, finendo allettata."

#: search2:search2_158883FF_2FA6_4886_B12D_DACD8C075266
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf98f377d40885652051fbc345da1cd45c8ba79894772f7fa5ae3f54e3862665
#. default-sha256: 3747b8f7a68877803edc049564f3407f46dc9689285b54ee4d19f40e3199d06a
msgctxt "search2:search2_158883FF_2FA6_4886_B12D_DACD8C075266"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I’ll take anything at this point to make her better.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I’ll even take a "
"miracle if I can get one.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Farei qualunque cosa a questo punto pur di farla stare meglio.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Accetterei anche un miracolo, se fosse possibile.”"

#: search2:search2_D35D0338_36F9_48EE_B187_CEDA1A5458C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b98637f1423e180ab8ee3533f0085dcfc9a5f12f25c700ff1f217cdb1219c1b3
#. default-sha256: 3602c0acd776edbe4e49f42bf1a24f077ddac56d7b7d5765a1e071c430135ca4
msgctxt "search2:search2_D35D0338_36F9_48EE_B187_CEDA1A5458C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And he believed it all.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫He led me to his house, where a pale, sickly "
"young girl lay in bed. ⟪k:5⟫She was a sweet little girl with the same flaxen hair as her brother "
"who looked like she would have been quite spirited if not for her ailment. ⟪k:6⟫It was touching "
"to see the two siblings sitting there together, quietly holding each other.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I "
"would gladly give my blood for the two of them.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫And so I made a new cut on my arm"
"—which had healed considerably thanks to the slave and the women of the brothel—⟪k:14⟫and let the "
"girl drink of my blood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E lui credette a ogni cosa.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Mi portò a casa sua, dove una pallida, "
"giovane ragazza ammalata giaceva nel letto. ⟪k:5⟫Era una dolce ragazzina con gli stessi capelli "
"dorati del fratello, e avrebbe dato l’idea di essere alquanto vivace, se solo non fosse stato per "
"la sua malattia. ⟪k:6⟫Vedere i due fratelli l’uno accanto all’altra, mentre si tenevano per mano "
"in silenzio, era commovente.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Avrei dato loro il mio sangue con piacere.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫E così feci un altro taglio sul mio braccio—⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫il quale era guarito "
"considerevolmente, grazie allo schiavo e alle donne del bordello—⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫e feci bere alla "
"ragazza il mio sangue."

#: search2:search2_48A4447F_5C21_460B_8E70_E23F3ED6183A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75a0abfcce01ebb390b579f14265d17ae1dc74627e95c0fc6e220e2fded5bd9f
#. default-sha256: 4ed2bcf8337cc5a79821b222e2f8bbb4948265eeeebc965ade34ba4a1d121af3
msgctxt "search2:search2_48A4447F_5C21_460B_8E70_E23F3ED6183A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nevertheless, I was prepared to give her my blood as many times⟪k:2⟫as needed. ⟪k:3⟫"
"Whenever her condition worsened, the young man came⟪k:4⟫to request more, and never once did I "
"turn him away. ⟪k:5⟫On the contrary,⟪k:6⟫I enthusiastically offered her my services.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫Over time, though, the hope in his eyes began to fade. ⟪k:10⟫He asked me on fewer walks, and "
"he seemed hesitant to look me in the eye.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫I assume it was out of discomfort"
"—out of guilt. ⟪k:15⟫Out of shame about asking for blood. ⟪k:16⟫But I don’t think his concerns "
"were for me—rather himself and his sister."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nonostante questo, ero pronta a darle il mio sangue tutte le volte che serviva. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Ogniqualvolta le sue condizioni peggioravano, il giovane veniva a chiederne dell’altro, e non lo "
"mandai via nemmeno una volta.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Al contrario, offrivo il mio aiuto con entusiasmo.⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Col tempo, però, la speranza nei suoi occhi cominciò a svanire.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Mi invitava a "
"passeggiare sempre di meno, e pareva restio a guardarmi negli occhi.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Penso "
"fosse per via del disagio—⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫per via del senso di colpa.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Per la vergogna nel "
"chiedere altro sangue. ⟪k:18⟫Ma non penso che le sue preoccupazioni fossero rivolte a me, quanto "
"piuttosto a se stesso e a sua sorella."

#: search2:search2_763E66E1_DA9C_4FEA_9AD3_9DB28D9544E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8dddbdfb857447be20743836ac79d5507587c9bd314d0f16732ca55fbd7989c4
#. default-sha256: 10c19b109779134d42692571982d74e3980f30b0d272ea0092266ffa9aac3a6f
msgctxt "search2:search2_763E66E1_DA9C_4FEA_9AD3_9DB28D9544E6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫As I mentioned earlier, blood was considered unclean in our time, ⟪k:2⟫and not only was "
"I giving mine away, I was having his sister imbibe it. ⟪k:3⟫Looking at it that way, it would "
"hardly be a surprise for him—or anyone else—to think what I was doing depraved.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫As "
"time passed, the flaxen-haired young man seemed to grow more and more disturbed by me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Come ho già detto prima, il sangue era considerato impuro ai nostri tempi, ⟪k:2⟫e non "
"solo stavo dando via il mio—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫lo stavo facendo bere a sua sorella. ⟪k:5⟫A vederla in "
"questo modo, non sarebbe stato difficile per lui—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫o per chiunque altro—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"pensare che quello che stavo facendo fosse indecente.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Col passare del tempo, il "
"ragazzo dai capelli biondi sembrava essere sempre più infastidito da me."

#: search2:search2_1C519B13_2487_4002_9F45_09D54A474E6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 201b94d071b2caa172792db91d26eda150e035725ce9caf33cf5f478853a1711
#. default-sha256: 195559661abb569d4839778642c68ba2275315ac21c7a8456e91ea24654c76a9
msgctxt "search2:search2_1C519B13_2487_4002_9F45_09D54A474E6A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That was what I got for opening up.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That was what I got for letting his "
"kind, warm light shine in on me.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The moment things went bad, he pulled away.⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫There were times when I thought I shouldn’t have done anything in the first place, but "
"regardless, I held fast to my original decision. ⟪k:11⟫I would put myself on the line for them."
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫No one else. ⟪k:15⟫Just them.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Even if he was afraid of me or "
"had no interest in seeing me, ⟪k:19⟫I would continue offering her my blood.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫And "
"I was firm in my resolve."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫È⟪k:3⟫ questo ciò che ottenni per essermi aperta.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫È⟪k:8⟫ questo "
"ciò che ottenni per aver lasciato che la sua luce calda e gentile risplendesse su di me.⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Nel momento in cui le cose cominciarono ad andar male, lui si allontanò.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫C’erano volte in cui pensavo che non avrei dovuto fare nulla sin⟪k:15⟫dal primo momento, ma "
"in ogni caso, rimasi fedele alla mia decisione iniziale. ⟪k:16⟫Mi sarei fatta avanti per loro."
"⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Solo per loro. ⟪k:20⟫E per nessun altro.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Anche se lui aveva "
"paura di me o se non aveva alcun interesse nel vedermi, ⟪k:24⟫avrei continuato ad offrire a sua "
"sorella il mio sangue.⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫Ed ero convinta della mia scelta."

#: search2:search2_39469C98_5F4C_4DA6_ACA6_64EDECCF52BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfe66002ef09718a423d0970c06b29475f66505d3ae697a4920963168dff6728
#. default-sha256: 044ff7995d3f50229948821a28e094aeeb3056227315ec27e6edcca945852b52
msgctxt "search2:search2_39469C98_5F4C_4DA6_ACA6_64EDECCF52BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫One day, though, I received a new visitor.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The young man was still the "
"only one I would show my face to—the only guest I had let into my walls. ⟪k:5⟫So, as usual, I "
"took the man’s request from behind the cottage door.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫But I could hardly believe my "
"ears when he began speaking."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Un giorno, però, arrivò un nuovo visitatore.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Il ragazzo era ancora "
"l’unico a cui avrei mostrato il mio volto—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫l’unico ospite che avrei accolto tra le mie "
"mura. ⟪k:7⟫E così, come al solito, ascoltai la richiesta dell’uomo da dietro la porta di casa."
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Tuttavia, quando iniziò a parlare, faticai a credere alle mie orecchie."

#: search2:search2_3156177A_00F4_4897_B057_59460387FD13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4295d76cc9d48a6ea820660ece890ff3f59e05e8d684787481954fbd402cb5c
#. default-sha256: d41b80847f53894502d43474a3c489addad09ddd99f61c9d4b43742e53173453
msgctxt "search2:search2_3156177A_00F4_4897_B057_59460387FD13"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Are you the witch with the miracle blood?”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Sei tu la strega col sangue miracoloso?”"

#: search2:search2_268BAB2C_F5A0_4FEF_A04F_0B20405C9255
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 142aa5c23b8946aaa467a7145e990c3faa77a68269375e5e88b33e2701fa5793
#. default-sha256: 66d714dd048e8fe8455a84c5363f67322f60f91add626439619fb09ee21de1ff
msgctxt "search2:search2_268BAB2C_F5A0_4FEF_A04F_0B20405C9255"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫First, ⟪k:2⟫how did he know my blood had powers?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Second, ⟪k:6⟫why had he "
"called me a witch and not a saint?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Third, ⟪k:10⟫why did he sound like the man who "
"had slaughtered the slave carriage?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Primo, ⟪k:2⟫come faceva a sapere che il mio sangue aveva dei poteri?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"Secondo, ⟪k:6⟫perché mi aveva chiamata strega e non santa?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Terzo, ⟪k:10⟫perché "
"aveva la stessa voce dell’uomo che aveva massacrato gli schiavi nel carro?"

#: search2:search2_66E0D963_9AB6_450D_8F22_3BEE7CAF26F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62fb7ddce0fa5564605e93591ebec1cd959753aaf8e57733cf974abc0adc6243
#. default-sha256: 69da0646cc471b256b2f3d35fb65b22057aeb7c989114f26797cf8d669ea2e25
msgctxt "search2:search2_66E0D963_9AB6_450D_8F22_3BEE7CAF26F4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My blood was for the sick and needy. ⟪k:2⟫I would never spare a drop for a murderer "
"like him.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫And I told the man exactly that, demanding he leave.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫All I "
"could think about was the pile of bodies. The fountain of blood. ⟪k:9⟫The man drenched in "
"crimson, wearing a ghastly smirk. ⟪k:10⟫I trembled behind the door, fearing he may go on another "
"such rampage.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫But instead, he gave a simple, “As you say,” and went on his way."
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫I let out a deep sigh of relief, ⟪k:18⟫which is when I realized tears "
"were rolling down both of my cheeks. ⟪k:19⟫Like an ordinary girl.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Three "
"days later, the flaxen-haired boy showed up at my cottage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il mio sangue era destinato ai malati e ai bisognosi. ⟪k:2⟫Non avrei mai concesso "
"nemmeno una goccia ad un assassino come lui.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫E dissi all’uomo esattamente questo, "
"pregandogli di andarsene.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Tutto ciò a cui riuscivo a pensare era l’ammasso di cadaveri. "
"⟪k:8⟫Il fiume di sangue. ⟪k:9⟫L’uomo intriso di cremisi dal sorriso agghiacciante.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫"
"Tremavo dietro la porta, temendo che egli potesse scatenarsi nuovamente in una furia omicida."
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Invece, mi disse soltanto, ⟪k:15⟫“Come vuoi”, rimettendosi in cammino.⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Tirai un profondo sospiro di sollievo, ⟪k:20⟫per poi accorgermi che le lacrime "
"stavano scendendo lungo le mie guance. ⟪k:21⟫Come una ragazza qualunque.⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫"
"Tre giorni dopo, il ragazzo dai capelli dorati si ripresentò alla mia porta."

#: search2:search2_4B7F9712_782D_488A_B202_AEF29E5E437C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32d4e96ba79f2ae7b7a6de32a09b2215e2a808f3c44c0bb204a50148bb157627
#. default-sha256: 6767242bb57c8e0c1c3bc0d8b4a4c08ccb10625fadec4aa3741ce03a084f9097
msgctxt "search2:search2_4B7F9712_782D_488A_B202_AEF29E5E437C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I’m sorry for being so distant lately...”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Mi dispiace per essere stato così distante ultimamente...”"

#: search2:search2_89A4710D_D668_40B6_8C0F_01EAD1C28449
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f225b2c4b5e3397a98fc68983a5f2866b53971ee4900192247a26004d7255a2
#. default-sha256: 045b400a9999f12af23c50f9669382c6ce948d0b81e281315e3b63b0820e1df8
msgctxt "search2:search2_89A4710D_D668_40B6_8C0F_01EAD1C28449"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“I want to talk things over...”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Vorrei parlarti, e sistemare le cose...”"

#: search2:search2_63F5048A_D1A2_4E02_8327_9A92812FDF7C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ddf95400d25050f3f611b73acd774f8ca604e24a8bf4a4c63db85c9509f722ee
#. default-sha256: 3dadb2cc4b0d3a80704513808ac34fc591d2b9c2d40ea64397e57837db3381aa
msgctxt "search2:search2_63F5048A_D1A2_4E02_8327_9A92812FDF7C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Those two sentences were like a light shining from above.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I wanted to "
"talk to him too. ⟪k:5⟫I wanted to take a walk around the lake and listen to him talk about "
"nothing. ⟪k:6⟫I wanted to experience the warmth of his world once more. ⟪k:7⟫And I wanted to tell "
"him about the terrible man who had been there a few days earlier.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫About how scared "
"I had been.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫I wanted him to tell me it would be all right."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quelle parole furono come un raggio di luce che splendeva dall’alto.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Anch’io volevo parlargli. ⟪k:5⟫Volevo passeggiare attorno al lago con lui⟪k:6⟫e ascoltarlo mentre "
"mi parlava del nulla. ⟪k:7⟫Volevo sentire il calore del suo mondo ancora una volta. ⟪k:8⟫Volevo "
"raccontargli dell’orribile uomo che era stato lì pochi giorni prima.⟪k:9⟫ E di quanto avessi "
"avuto paura.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Volevo che mi dicesse che sarebbe andato tutto bene."

#: search2:search2_3D8949E0_D176_4AA8_86CB_560BE99FDA4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad95fc1688b751bf9d39b623067ee6c00f72d2f4f08f10cd7d51473767f5a2ce
#. default-sha256: 8d271271da787d3c19fe2bda3ac48d923334b5b96ee8237acd1a679f0381c7cc
msgctxt "search2:search2_3D8949E0_D176_4AA8_86CB_560BE99FDA4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I said, opening the door without a second thought.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The light of the sun "
"was so bright all I could make out was his silhouette. ⟪k:5⟫I couldn’t see the look on his face "
"or the look in his eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dissi, aprendo la porta senza pensarci due volte.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫La luce del sole era "
"così intensa che non riuscivo a vedere altro che⟪k:5⟫la sua sagoma. ⟪k:6⟫Non riuscivo a scorgere "
"l’espressione sul suo viso,⟪k:7⟫né lo sguardo nei suoi occhi."

#: search2:search2_F05F1DDC_1CDA_40DA_93F2_CD953ADAE180
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 755238acaadaa219544b95af078d98eba088536c9293af0aeb3e1d74b7ac6612
#. default-sha256: 4f37e74d2b0a8e89af8df9ccc44e7a2e86d8344a67901a8a992842b610aef1d1
msgctxt "search2:search2_F05F1DDC_1CDA_40DA_93F2_CD953ADAE180"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A gentle breeze blew past.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And my mind froze.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫How could "
"this be happening?⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫What did it mean?⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Why?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫How?"
"⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫What was that man doing ⟪k:20⟫standing behind him?⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Why was he "
"carrying a sword?⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫Why was he coming into my house?⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫And "
"why did he swing it down,⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫severing my arm?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Una brezza gentile mi passò accanto.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫E la mia mente si congelò.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫Com’era potuto accadere?⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Cosa voleva dire?⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Perché?⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Come?⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Cosa ci faceva ⟪k:20⟫quell’uomo ⟪k:21⟫dietro di lui?⟪k:22⟫"
"⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫Perché portava con sé una spada?⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫Perché veniva verso casa mia?⟪k:28⟫"
"⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫E perché agitò la spada,⟪k:32⟫ tagliandomi il braccio?"

#: search2:search2_61C2CC73_AEA9_4999_8D52_C92C7D3979CB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60063242e89e011275bdc17a09cb834b881f5008aafdbeed7da612df5c0e558f
#. default-sha256: 2e1612a50ecea5bf0217a679f22db6f88e57deb4e05582a8806bf2c617eb7c55
msgctxt "search2:search2_61C2CC73_AEA9_4999_8D52_C92C7D3979CB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It was a hideous, visceral noise. ⟪k:2⟫A sound I had never thought a saint could make. "
"⟪k:3⟫The same ear-splitting howl the slaves had made as the man had butchered them.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"I writhed. I wailed. I wept. I crawled across the floor through my own blood. ⟪k:7⟫I begged and I "
"begged and I begged for my life.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫The man walked over and picked up my severed arm, "
"⟪k:11⟫and then, shockingly, he tossed it to the kindhearted young man, ⟪k:12⟫after which he said,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Era un verso orribile e viscerale. ⟪k:2⟫Un suono che non avevo mai pensato che una "
"santa potesse produrre. ⟪k:3⟫Lo stesso guaito assordante emesso da quegli schiavi mentre l’uomo "
"li trucidava.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Mi contorsi. Mi lamentai. Piansi. Strisciai sul pavimento inondato "
"dal mio stesso sangue. ⟪k:7⟫Supplicai e supplicai e supplicai per la mia vita.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"L’uomo si avvicinò, raccolse il mio braccio mozzato,⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫e poi, inaspettatamente, lo "
"lanciò a quel giovane gentile.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Dopodiché disse,"

#: search2:search2_C8410C8E_5A6F_45A3_8E07_E4CD8FB4B1AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d397a74c7daa49f6950fbb1b4316a2f0daa38b7b44e90ef6d77f92073f9ff452
#. default-sha256: b822843b6ee4ffd16ca64611751fa2449cd8a504b87274bf895a33c79a7fc69d
msgctxt "search2:search2_C8410C8E_5A6F_45A3_8E07_E4CD8FB4B1AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Share?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫What did he mean by “share”?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫What was he talking "
"about?⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Why had he given him my arm—and why had he taken it?⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Why "
"was he talking like they knew each other?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Why? Why?⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫I had "
"spared blood for him when he asked, hadn’t I? ⟪k:20⟫So why was he doing this?⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫"
"Was cutting my arm off and stealing it easier on his conscience than simply ⟪k:24⟫asking⟪k:25⟫?"
"⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫You understand how I felt, don’t you?⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫You can put "
"yourself in my shoes, can’t you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Parte?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Che intendeva dire con “parte”?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Di cosa stava "
"parlando?⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Perché gli aveva dato il mio braccio—⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫e perché lui l’aveva "
"preso?⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Perché parlava come se si conoscessero?⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Perché? Perché?"
"⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Gli avevo concesso il mio sangue quando l’aveva chiesto, non è così? ⟪k:22⟫"
"Allora perché stava facendo questo?⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫Secondo la sua coscienza era più facile "
"tagliarmi il braccio e rubarmelo piuttosto che ⟪k:26⟫chiedermelo⟪k:27⟫?⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫Tu "
"⟪k:32⟫capisci⟪k:33⟫ come mi sentivo, vero?⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫Tu ⟪k:37⟫riesci⟪k:38⟫ a metterti nei "
"miei panni, vero?"

#: search2:search2_773AFB1F_D3FC_4BDC_B7B7_1794926E3F69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: abe8b51bc8ad318f60d1628219cab983a19a43a04170f4ef85d19e449d015545
#. default-sha256: 46f178b9b65578b566eba6371e0328bbc295a1aeca3320ff1ca38bf829511b24
msgctxt "search2:search2_773AFB1F_D3FC_4BDC_B7B7_1794926E3F69"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The young man refused to look me in the eye. ⟪k:2⟫Holding my bloody arm in his "
"trembling hands, he fled from the cottage as quickly as his legs would allow.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The "
"man then walked over and picked me up.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I had neither the strength nor willpower to "
"resist.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Holding me in his arms, he began to speak.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Telling me "
"things I didn’t want to know.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Things I didn’t want to hear.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫But "
"he didn’t care."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il giovane si rifiutò di guardarmi negli occhi. ⟪k:2⟫Tenendo il mio braccio "
"insanguinato tra le sue mani tremolanti, scappò via dalla dimora quanto più veloce le sue gambe "
"gli permettevano.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫L’uomo allora si avvicinò e mi raccolse da terra.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"Non avevo né le energie né la forza di volontà per oppormi.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Tenendomi in braccio, "
"iniziò a parlare.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Dicendomi cose che non volevo sapere.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Cose "
"che non volevo ascoltare.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Ma a lui non importava."

#: search2:search2_F75B0BC6_CD39_4664_AC75_3167EE58A243
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5af00cf98b988a5a5de7f923888867937e1986175780b5d6fc5140db82c0dd22
#. default-sha256: 6e78d0ab1678b820c88c88e3858a6d5ca8861cde351f9f42ac36d437d06ded73
msgctxt "search2:search2_F75B0BC6_CD39_4664_AC75_3167EE58A243"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Nothing personal. I just need your blood.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Niente di personale. Ho solo bisogno del tuo sangue.”"

#: search2:search2_11369757_332F_4130_A71A_287590EB6D56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f695e6bec4caf962c156ef353e0c378fe71c7aeb334b23c9a147bc73e1505f1c
#. default-sha256: cc43b473fea1d0add08d7a825a46871c1bf029d8a102017f00a9cb808048f75c
msgctxt "search2:search2_11369757_332F_4130_A71A_287590EB6D56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Without it, she’ll lose her church.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Senza di quello, lei perderà la sua chiesa.”"

#: search2:search2_84C0E871_4E4E_4065_9055_55456FCCFBC0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e0e69d482cbf5276d262952721afe085706025cca2e07a5e1a5d28064570ce5
#. default-sha256: 4854f24cd72e82765162061fa8b555f12d38c706afce6c6b73c1decbee3f5d2b
msgctxt "search2:search2_84C0E871_4E4E_4065_9055_55456FCCFBC0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫How could I ⟪k:2⟫not⟪k:3⟫ hold a grudge?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫How could I ⟪k:7⟫not⟪k:8⟫ "
"despise them?⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫How could I possibly forgive them?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Tell me, please."
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Tell me, how could I?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Come potrei ⟪k:2⟫non⟪k:3⟫ serbare rancore?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Come potrei ⟪k:7⟫non⟪k:8⟫ "
"odiarli?⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Come potrei mai perdonarli?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Dimmelo, ti prego.⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Dimmelo, come potrei?!"

#: search2:search2_508A1570_9B15_44CC_B46B_3B12B131CBDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1eb5c4d7e87da1381a0705448473055ca1f90854689c714ab3df3f55d57164ab
#. default-sha256: d82c711a82fa4b421f62c4157dcac1ed2109a0a54580b0d8b199813e75c84c07
msgctxt "search2:search2_508A1570_9B15_44CC_B46B_3B12B131CBDC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“She needs the money.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Le servono i soldi.”"

#: search2:search2_3C835617_FE2B_4BB6_A129_DC7164284E49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd499e763107420149b7bfbe50d645e2a9e389ef3f9d8bf3f98b96480d69d9f2
#. default-sha256: c5137618cd3aca84ecc5499aea5e2ec18377a52e9dff80dcce48873217d94166
msgctxt "search2:search2_3C835617_FE2B_4BB6_A129_DC7164284E49"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“I needed some way of getting enough money⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫to keep her church running.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Dovevo trovare un modo per procurarmi abbastanza denaro⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫da mandare avanti la "
"sua chiesa.”"

#: search2:search2_B0F6C89D_1614_4BF4_AA66_6BC1CB5A0166
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 451e4dccfc98a4d3912fadf5fd07bb01389cefab24b08c122cd43d850d361d40
#. default-sha256: 356619e6ca3138569e4fb6342bf30decaec060b95766549b215f75f34741ac52
msgctxt "search2:search2_B0F6C89D_1614_4BF4_AA66_6BC1CB5A0166"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“If I brought him the witch with the miracle blood,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫he would finance a whole "
"new church for her.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Se gli avessi portato la strega col sangue miracoloso,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫lui avrebbe finanziato "
"una nuova chiesa tutta per lei.”"

#: search2:search2_1B01C5B2_4399_4C85_B551_DD668454F45F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f1c4d86da142b183d7b1d3c93ad52243086beae6bfad88fed93ca77bf98ba46
#. default-sha256: da17bb0d849b3e9b9aa50c805c665d6ad08fcd4551a92bc84df9c08cd7162d73
msgctxt "search2:search2_1B01C5B2_4399_4C85_B551_DD668454F45F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“to keep her church from collapsing.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫To keep her world from collapsing.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“che impedirà alla sua chiesa di crollare.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Che impedirà al suo mondo di "
"crollare.”"

#: search2:search2_513CF30B_D0B2_4BF0_81E9_01C712E15CA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db6a3c8a19cb1ab9d00e0ed9adf60c748d938aa7f297a7c8c5c903305614dea0
#. default-sha256: decef5fa34103eb36e736f7ca2d7afaa443c1c573e179d3f0a32417e2533e9b9
msgctxt "search2:search2_513CF30B_D0B2_4BF0_81E9_01C712E15CA3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I⟪k:3⟫ was the saint.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Why was this woman, who didn’t have the "
"ability to perform miracles, being worshiped like she did? ⟪k:7⟫Why did the people of the city "
"idolize her? ⟪k:8⟫Why were their smiles all directed at her?⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Why...⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫was I...⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫not in her place?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ero ⟪k:2⟫io⟪k:3⟫ la santa.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Perché quella donna, che non aveva il potere "
"di compiere miracoli, veniva adorata come se lo avesse? ⟪k:7⟫Perché la gente della città la "
"idolatrava? ⟪k:8⟫Perché i loro sorrisi erano tutti diretti a lei?⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Perché..."
"⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫non c’ero io...⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫al suo posto?"

#: search2:search2_BFC582D8_5DB5_43F3_99B8_F4CFAAD8CB4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d13c31d1f00a0719df477e8651e7e11c056564b80483681189fae7ce8f736ebb
#. default-sha256: 3efc47d613ccfaa3dbdbb611188a293b926d8f9beadbbc92fc56d89bad40a8a3
msgctxt "search2:search2_BFC582D8_5DB5_43F3_99B8_F4CFAAD8CB4F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The man carried me to the top of the observation tower. ⟪k:2⟫It was there... ⟪k:3⟫that "
"I had my reunion with the lord."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫L’uomo mi portò in cima alla torre d’osservazione. ⟪k:2⟫Fu lì...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫che "
"rincontrai il lord."

#: search2:search2_23FE4E35_1CE4_4AE8_9EC9_E05DF038257D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32948070f92acf764896b2afd589757459eb6c8b18ede4b51444d4159bdd02b4
#. default-sha256: 98453fba3bd6b0c2bdea052e56799835e9a258551c871d38f3be9a43dd24626e
msgctxt "search2:search2_23FE4E35_1CE4_4AE8_9EC9_E05DF038257D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I was to spill my blood for the people of the city. ⟪k:6⟫But also "
"for the lord’s profit.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫He was not offering free aid, but selling it as medicine. "
"⟪k:10⟫He claimed it was a miracle elixir, telling no one that it was actually my blood. ⟪k:11⟫It "
"was mixed with a beautiful red wine, and drinking it would cure you of any ailment.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫If they knew it was actually the blood of a witch, they would think it unclean. They would "
"fear it.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Ahaha...⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Ahahahahahaha...⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫"
"Ahahahahahahahahahahahahahaha..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Dovevo versare il mio sangue per il popolo della città. ⟪k:6⟫Ma "
"anche per gli interessi del lord.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Non lo offriva per aiutare la gente, bensì lo "
"vendeva come medicinale. ⟪k:10⟫Affermava che fosse un elisir miracoloso, senza dire a nessuno che "
"in realtà era il mio sangue. ⟪k:11⟫Veniva mischiato con dell’ottimo vino rosso, e bevendolo "
"avrebbe curato ogni male.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Se avessero saputo che era il sangue di una strega, lo "
"avrebbero considerato impuro. Lo avrebbero temuto.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Ahaha...⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫"
"Ahahahahahaha...⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫Ahahahahahahahahahahahahahaha..."

#: search2:search2_81345CCB_66E5_47B9_A631_F8CB42FE90BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0aac5892e9408a7e3b5c7572ee3f7faef2c54c12f560bc16c496d8939a415f35
#. default-sha256: 5a15931dceacb48b1e671679034dfe29f3db3147155cb1641d3106eee6798528
msgctxt "search2:search2_81345CCB_66E5_47B9_A631_F8CB42FE90BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Time went on, and I grew progressively weaker.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I lost the will to eat—and "
"the will to live.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫My only view from the tower was the clouds through a window high "
"up on the wall. ⟪k:8⟫Occasionally, a pigeon would fly in, ⟪k:9⟫sometimes a butterfly, ⟪k:10⟫and I "
"would glare in envy as it fluttered around, free to come and go as it pleased."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il tempo andò avanti, e divenni sempre più debole.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Persi la voglia di "
"mangiare—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫e la voglia di vivere.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫L’unica cosa che riuscivo a vedere dalla "
"torre erano le nuvole attraverso la finestra in cima al muro. ⟪k:10⟫Ogni tanto, entrava un "
"piccione,⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫a volte una farfalla, ⟪k:13⟫e io morivo d’invidia mentre svolazzavano qua e "
"là, liberi di entrare ed uscire quando volevano."

#: search2:search2_47012167_C7E1_419D_8AA7_917F168C5343
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7db7a5bcb713988905ad8d36d4b49b692f99ea82ad672a7dadfe10d20aaf52b4
#. default-sha256: 4f4e7ce1dd9d56452edb6655a6bf56ca550401a4d9b4a7fd873f531ea6b893b6
msgctxt "search2:search2_47012167_C7E1_419D_8AA7_917F168C5343"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And soon, it was spring.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Every spring, the church held a festival to pray "
"for the coming year’s harvest and the people’s wellbeing. ⟪k:5⟫I could hear the bustle from far "
"below through the window as everyone rushed to prepare."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E presto, arrivò la primavera.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ogni primavera, la chiesa teneva una festa "
"per celebrare l’arrivo del raccolto dell’anno e il benessere del popolo. ⟪k:5⟫Attraverso la "
"finestra riuscivo a sentire il trambusto proveniente dal basso mentre tutti si affrettavano nelle "
"preparazioni."

#: search2:search2_44DBED03_F517_4117_A0DB_093369E13042
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 272e3fbcbe4f94bb72b722a44e6b69079a74fb807a1b9a98d5c4565073639539
#. default-sha256: a91c3dd63d49516c6bfa5a970dd41270a835650635553a055dd8fc7f0c5c5e5b
msgctxt "search2:search2_44DBED03_F517_4117_A0DB_093369E13042"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I heard people praising the “Saintess”—though ⟪k:2⟫I⟪k:3⟫, the true saint, was locked "
"in the tower.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I heard people thanking the lord for his generous donations and "
"miracle medicine—though it had all come from me.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Propped up on my suffering, ⟪k:10⟫"
"they cheered and clinked glasses of my bloody wine."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sentivo la gente lodare la “Santa”—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫nonostante ⟪k:4⟫io⟪k:5⟫, la vera santa, "
"fossi rinchiusa nella torre.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Sentivo la gente ringraziare il lord per le sue "
"generose donazioni e per la medicina miracolosa—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫sebbene provenisse tutto da me.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Sostenuti dalla mia sofferenza, brindavano, facendo tintinnare i bicchieri colmi del "
"mio vino insanguinato."

#: search2:search2_1223175D_29EB_4B25_922C_3014024169C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ef99ed4db1f1eb29822dde97610939157ade6dbd99af97574a08a5c4c1a580b
#. default-sha256: b189040fd8d263b4cfb7b4952617f65ab1df0d26f783dee605edd528565227dd
msgctxt "search2:search2_1223175D_29EB_4B25_922C_3014024169C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Those merry...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫peaceful...⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫cheerful...⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫spirited sinners’ voices...⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫resounded in my tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Le allegre...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫tranquille...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫serene voci "
"spensierate di quei peccatori...⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫risuonavano nella torre."

#: search2:search2_AA0BC909_A9E4_47BD_B36F_5B9D3F51D0B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 227b80ba7580c347a9c320a12e810ba69125a4225a851e7f5e7c1a1110a27a85
#. default-sha256: be436df732ee0e895d970fc4b48e306bd77d7186923664342e5ec0f64744ed51
msgctxt "search2:search2_AA0BC909_A9E4_47BD_B36F_5B9D3F51D0B4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The lord gave my corpse a casual glance,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and said stonefaced,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il lord lanciò un’occhiata indifferente al mio cadavere,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫e disse "
"imperterrito,"

#: search2:search2_5AC72E41_4150_4A5B_B5AC_447276CF9678
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fbcd36480b0ce8ed588466092b52d99ed1b1e2214cbdc0111a2011c93b6b87f3
#. default-sha256: e212b9b0347f8c366fab65e15d30c928e247d75dd4a0db15d0f5717c380d7913
msgctxt "search2:search2_5AC72E41_4150_4A5B_B5AC_447276CF9678"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“How... can you be so calm?!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Do you understand what you’ve done?”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Come puoi essere così calmo?!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Hai capito cos’hai fatto?!”"

#: search2:search2_AC49DB02_5520_4208_A28B_6BC3497DBF5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3eabb39e1f9b8635de3f4d3d8d2b1f256b1e7b355c6a84a0a4bf1da75e6f479a
#. default-sha256: 55306162c3e2c06a8fd033adb41859218962274c84bc39f71371f2334992df97
msgctxt "search2:search2_AC49DB02_5520_4208_A28B_6BC3497DBF5F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The swordsman—who had been silently observing⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫the lord and the boy "
"conversing—interjected,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Lo spadaccino—che era rimasto ad osservare in silenzio⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫il "
"lord e il ragazzo che discutevano—si intromise,⟪k:8⟫"

#: search2:search2_C396F1A2_065E_47D4_A632_E6625AAA9A30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f5d57e085867d6a90c9a5ace1172f6aeebf9e7c253c1a970f989668b384f359
#. default-sha256: 2f99759d9c358a06fbc9abb299f14919fe0fe994cbb13b0eb259b6485aeb0813
msgctxt "search2:search2_C396F1A2_065E_47D4_A632_E6625AAA9A30"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“You’re just as guilty as any of us.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Sei colpevole tanto quanto noi.”"

#: search2:search2_EA31D2A2_E164_4FEE_8062_FAEFDCADAAE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da8ddda095a30707c6b45713f18fcf290b34e3af7b6871492f0097df63d79c79
#. default-sha256: aff821a22af6a9f195aafd8f66edf5f6520a393a5be2d9f25e7776c0a1595766
msgctxt "search2:search2_EA31D2A2_E164_4FEE_8062_FAEFDCADAAE4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Not only did they not mourn my death—they argued over whose fault it was. ⟪k:2⟫There "
"was no regret—no remorse.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The young man muttered absentmindedly, ⟪k:6⟫“I... I never "
"⟪k:7⟫wanted⟪k:8⟫ her to die...”⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫What did his ⟪k:12⟫intentions⟪k:13⟫ matter, "
"though? ⟪k:14⟫It was his betrayal that had ultimately tethered me to this mansion.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫But the fact that they didn’t grieve my death... ⟪k:19⟫and instead squabbled amongst "
"themselves like filthy rats... ⟪k:20⟫was the final straw."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non solo non piangevano la mia morte—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫discutevano su chi avesse⟪k:4⟫la colpa. "
"⟪k:5⟫Non c’era nessun rimorso—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫nessun rammarico.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Il ragazzo borbottò "
"distrattamente,⟪k:11⟫ “Io... ⟪k:12⟫non ho ⟪k:13⟫mai voluto⟪k:14⟫ che morisse...”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"Ma che importanza avevano le sue ⟪k:18⟫intenzioni⟪k:19⟫? ⟪k:20⟫In fin dei conti, era stato il suo "
"tradimento ad avermi costretta in quella villa.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫Ma il fatto che non "
"fossero in lutto per la mia morte... ⟪k:25⟫bisticciando tra loro come ratti schifosi... ⟪k:26⟫fu "
"l’ultima goccia."

#: search2:search2_96C9AB6B_10E5_4F4F_B3E1_7362BC5E85DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01d44e68032667543c5b2045c10b2f61840c681ca06ad32c5d61c7aecfb99834
#. default-sha256: cfbc167334b80a79099bd9bf97fbf082b132b3940e444c12ba33182d73288638
msgctxt "search2:search2_96C9AB6B_10E5_4F4F_B3E1_7362BC5E85DF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫How could I ⟪k:4⟫not⟪k:5⟫ despise them?⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Come potrei ⟪k:4⟫non⟪k:5⟫ odiarli?⟪k:6⟫"

#: search2:search2_F30E9911_97B5_4F96_A930_941C37493A57
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c0abdef959fc3993f7d04006233f4ac3f4b6f65d5b8e158d64592d815bf7e00
#. default-sha256: 440f6801fd64b80368386b0febc9c38c2378ffa4e7362636cf6f5674361e84e7
msgctxt "search2:search2_F30E9911_97B5_4F96_A930_941C37493A57"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I don’t believe I actually had the power to perform miracles when I was alive. ⟪k:2⟫It "
"was all faith—⟪k:3⟫the illusion of belief.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I was neither a saint nor a witch.⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫The blood wine was only effective because people placed their faith in the other "
"“Saintess.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫I was only ever human."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non credo affatto che avessi il potere di compiere miracoli quando ero in vita. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Non era altro che l’illusione della fede.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Non ero né una santa né una strega.⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Il vino insanguinato era efficace solo perché la gente riponeva la propria fede "
"nell’altra “Santa”.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ero stata sempre e soltanto umana."

#: search2:search2_B4504D02_0981_443C_B804_2831336A7ECA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0db9d53107aa0486e27bf3a16d28a79fdac5dfae68cea8d59f2a0274c6e9e51d
#. default-sha256: fa0e36169a51a2986362cad48503a3c9e9fa4da0bd2b3253f2f95f46e7a3b895
msgctxt "search2:search2_B4504D02_0981_443C_B804_2831336A7ECA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And so I made my “wish.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Most people might consider it a curse, but to "
"me, it was most certainly a wish. ⟪k:5⟫And my Father—or maybe the Devil—granted that wish!⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫From the garden, ⟪k:10⟫there rose a scream. ⟪k:11⟫The flaxen-haired young man knew "
"that voice better than anyone. ⟪k:12⟫He went deathly pale, darting down the spiral staircase "
"until he reached a window.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫A young girl was on her knees, vomiting blood "
"in the grass."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E così espressi il mio “desiderio”.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫La maggior parte della gente "
"l’avrebbe cosiderata una maledizione, ma per me, era di certo un desiderio. ⟪k:5⟫E mio Padre—⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫o forse il Diavolo—⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫lo esaudì!⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Dal giardino, ⟪k:14⟫si "
"sollevò un grido. ⟪k:15⟫Il ragazzo dai capelli biondi conosceva quella voce meglio di chiunque "
"altro. ⟪k:16⟫Divenne bianco cadaverico, e si lanciò giù per le scale a chiocciola fino a "
"raggiungere⟪k:17⟫la finestra.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Una ragazzina era in ginocchio, e stava "
"vomitando sangue sul prato."

#: search2:search2_8F9B772C_1BDB_483A_B813_8E71566AA03C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d4c587516248ca642ff4b59e9145d272cead479e967d51ef68b629906448a88
#. default-sha256: a05afb1e3151912a8a0829ae52649ab30e8ac06d1f86170027d075010375a7f5
msgctxt "search2:search2_8F9B772C_1BDB_483A_B813_8E71566AA03C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“That wine you’re drinking is no medicine!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Quel vino che state bevendo non è una medicina!”"

#: search2:search2_A5409E40_F807_4CF8_BCB0_0ECFA2BE964C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4b4ebe3faaa983b03a3ef88a426fb76e3be2a180c044c08d033ce7404106028
#. default-sha256: 92a3d16ad89ad227c3c01d20506cc3d4981f860d97b0f8836176397bca310899
msgctxt "search2:search2_A5409E40_F807_4CF8_BCB0_0ECFA2BE964C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The nun was the first target of their outrage.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫What she had claimed to be "
"medicine ⟪k:5⟫had turned out to be blood—an unclean substance. ⟪k:6⟫The blood of a witch, no less."
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫A servant of the Church—a servant of the Lord—had given her followers blood to "
"drink.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫And at this, their indignation surged uncontrollably."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫La suora fu il primo bersaglio della loro collera.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ciò che lei aveva "
"dichiarato essere un medicinale ⟪k:5⟫si scoprì essere sangue—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫una sostanza impura. ⟪k:8⟫"
"Il sangue di una strega, per giunta.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Una servitrice della Chiesa—⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫una "
"servitrice del Signore—⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫aveva dato da bere del sangue ai propri seguaci.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫E per questo, la loro indignazione crebbe senza controllo."

#: search2:search2_210C09EE_BB41_4179_8290_604B318B65B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b77c5303e888bbff9b92a25f641a694b9fb831a339be5a9413fc142db9524a2a
#. default-sha256: 41886b2e2ab171fd903832218b7dd1ef767403691681e180ee2ea79cfb7c4b12
msgctxt "search2:search2_210C09EE_BB41_4179_8290_604B318B65B6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The people surrounded her, tying her up and throwing her to the ground. ⟪k:2⟫As they "
"prepared to inflict righteous justice upon her, the swordsman soared down the stairs and into the "
"garden, plunging his blade into anyone standing near the nun.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The cries of agony "
"ringing through the church grounds were ear-splitting. ⟪k:6⟫It was no longer a place of God—but "
"Hell on Earth. ⟪k:7⟫Hell built up by the hands of man. ⟪k:8⟫Hell painted red with the blood of "
"their brothers."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il popolo la circondò, legandola e gettandola a terra. ⟪k:2⟫Mentre si preparavano per "
"infliggerle la giusta condanna, lo spadaccino schizzò giù per le scale fino al giardino, "
"trafiggendo con la sua spada chiunque si trovava vicino alla suora.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Le urla di "
"dolore che risuonavano nella chiesa erano assordanti.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Non era più la casa di Dio—⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫ma l’Inferno sulla Terra. ⟪k:10⟫L’Inferno messo in piedi dalle mani degli uomini. ⟪k:11⟫"
"L’Inferno dipinto di rosso col sangue dei loro fratelli."

#: search2:search2_B507AAEE_793D_4CF3_B5C2_995B9F14FBB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf4fba4023cf604295b1467fb3e3c9f499578d6ca07d0d6a50e16a46f6619a98
#. default-sha256: 803b29e97a149aab41fc849d79c254e419acad3707a5f2d4b03dea51afce9b4e
msgctxt "search2:search2_B507AAEE_793D_4CF3_B5C2_995B9F14FBB4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The people armed themselves with anything they could find and went after the man. ⟪k:2⟫"
"As much of a beast as he may have been, ⟪k:3⟫he stood little chance against such numbers.⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫It is the fate of a beast to be exterminated by those he terrorizes. ⟪k:8⟫And once "
"he was gone, the nun had no one left to protect her. ⟪k:9⟫She too was consumed by their frenzy."
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫All that remained was an inextinguishable inferno.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Hysteria "
"and despair.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫Madness and outrage—⟪k:19⟫and no outlet for it.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫It "
"was a revolt that made the slaves’ uprising at the lord’s manor look like a game."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Gli uomini si armarono con qualunque cosa riuscivano a trovare⟪k:2⟫e si diressero verso "
"la suora. ⟪k:3⟫Per quanto potesse essere una bestia, ⟪k:4⟫l’uomo aveva ben poche possibilità "
"contro un tale numero.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫È⟪k:10⟫ il destino di una bestia venire abbattuta "
"da coloro che terrorizza.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫E una volta ucciso, non rimase più nessuno che potesse "
"proteggere la suora. ⟪k:13⟫Anche lei venne consumata dalla loro furia.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Tutto ciò "
"che restava era un inestinguibile inferno.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Isteria e disperazione.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫"
"⟪k:22⟫Follia e collera—⟪k:23⟫e nessuno sbocco da cui uscire.⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫Era una rivolta che "
"faceva sembrare l’insurrezione degli schiavi alla tenuta del lord un misero gioco."

#: search2:search2_C7935711_6F4C_4DFD_BC3B_ECE822B612EE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc29662e313e8699530f3ff40c3cd3d36e3c703458f74dedcd4ce01bae739d04
#. default-sha256: 317b35b03063afd4e37af46d9e041d63016dad391d7c0e0adee3e1d6c84a8704
msgctxt "search2:search2_C7935711_6F4C_4DFD_BC3B_ECE822B612EE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eventually, their rage found a new target—the lord. ⟪k:2⟫It was only natural, for he "
"⟪k:3⟫was⟪k:4⟫ the true villain.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫He was the one who had given money—and the witch’s "
"blood—to the church. ⟪k:8⟫He was the one who had profited off it.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫And above all, "
"people often resented those who stood above them. ⟪k:12⟫Particularly in times of unrest.⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫The city resounded with cries for the lord’s head."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Infine, la loro rabbia trovò un nuovo bersaglio—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫il lord. ⟪k:4⟫Era più che "
"naturale, essendo ⟪k:5⟫lui⟪k:6⟫ il vero cattivo.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Era stato lui ad aver procurato il "
"denaro—e il sangue della strega—alla chiesa. ⟪k:10⟫Era stato lui l’unico ad averci guadagnato."
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫E soprattutto, le persone non sopportano chi è al di sopra di loro.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫"
"In particolar modo durante periodi di malcontento.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫L’intera città chiedeva "
"la sua testa."

#: search2:search2_53D2C993_3E8B_407C_BE57_8430F4D6FC62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e94572ac7041baba51b38e3dcbec5d9aa6485367e223dca23fb9679400c3d58f
#. default-sha256: bdedf35d4ee6d406275e44f8d274cf03c51d2780d90376ad39a465731037a9aa
msgctxt "search2:search2_53D2C993_3E8B_407C_BE57_8430F4D6FC62"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫With that, the raging furor mostly settled down, but it was hardly the end of the "
"destruction. ⟪k:2⟫Mere days later, a plague befell the city.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Dreadful black spots "
"covered the flesh of the infected. ⟪k:6⟫They writhed in pain, screaming and vomiting blood. ⟪k:7⟫"
"Ghastly howls echoed through the streets—as though the whole city had been possessed. ⟪k:8⟫It "
"became a cursed land.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫In their diseased haze, the people muttered again and "
"again,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E così, l’ira impetuosa si placò,⟪k:2⟫ ma non era affatto la fine della distruzione. "
"⟪k:3⟫Pochi giorni dopo, una piaga colpì la città.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Orribili macchie nere coprirono "
"la pelle degli infetti.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Si contorcevano dal dolore, urlando e vomitando sangue.⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫Urla agghiaccianti echeggiavano per le strade—⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫come se l’intera città fosse "
"stata posseduta. ⟪k:13⟫Divenne una terra maledetta.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Nella loro febbrile "
"confusione, gli abitanti borbottavano ancora⟪k:18⟫e ancora,"

#: search2:search2_90684BFF_2F0D_4D0B_B5EB_E8F9CFD38C09
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6cc15e2bb1d2748f4209ce4949662a02a3eb050a6a453a1097fafd111af38d2c
#. default-sha256: fbaafb8667cb1aebe461531e3b835954d0b7d5d28904fcf48ee7a610c8073852
msgctxt "search2:search2_90684BFF_2F0D_4D0B_B5EB_E8F9CFD38C09"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“We have been cursed by the witch!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Siamo stati maledetti dalla strega!”"

#: search2:search2_96CB9713_8876_46E6_8C86_85EB9C18DB5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac3ac4987da31c18117a3c124d962695ffcfc7db22ae1fa807f8e811933aed5d
#. default-sha256: fe3e76cd68259bd9aa9d0d4e46069d8de3b8c82890c4521bc7605247fc19c527
msgctxt "search2:search2_96CB9713_8876_46E6_8C86_85EB9C18DB5F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My body was left abandoned at the top of the observation tower.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And as if "
"to seal the curse away, in their final days, the people shuttered all the windows, wrapping the "
"house in darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il mio corpo rimase abbandonato in cima alla torre d’osservazione.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫E come "
"se avessero voluto sigillare la maledizione, nei loro ultimi giorni, gli abitanti avevano "
"barricato tutte le finestre, facendo calare il buio nella villa."

#: search2:search2_1CCF9033_B827_4EEE_A611_24DFE73697F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65c6638f7b08078fc72870f88720e14e93b91295e9c24efc14c2bacfc5d9f551
#. default-sha256: 31c44e365acdcdc300771de7bbb8f5cf59a3d9463fc2ab370bc63d31b8776aed
msgctxt "search2:search2_1CCF9033_B827_4EEE_A611_24DFE73697F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But I wish to believe it ⟪k:2⟫was⟪k:3⟫ a miracle.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫That even if my blood "
"didn’t have healing properties, ⟪k:7⟫and even if I wasn’t a saint, ⟪k:8⟫my wish—my curse—⟪k:9⟫was "
"what caused that uprising.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫That ⟪k:13⟫that⟪k:14⟫ was my miracle.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫Granted to me by God—or the Devil.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫I choose to believe that.⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫"
"⟪k:23⟫And that my miracle took on its true form thereafter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ma voglio credere che fosse ⟪k:2⟫davvero⟪k:3⟫ un miracolo.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Anche se il "
"mio sangue non aveva proprietà curative, ⟪k:7⟫e anche se non ero una santa, ⟪k:8⟫voglio credere "
"che sia stato il mio desiderio—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫la mia maledizione—⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫ad aver causato quella "
"rivolta.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Che ⟪k:16⟫quello⟪k:17⟫ fosse il mio miracolo.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫"
"Concessomi da Dio—⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫o dal Diavolo.⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫Ho scelto di crederci.⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"⟪k:28⟫E di credere che il mio miracolo abbia assunto la sua vera forma da quel momento in poi."

#: search2:search2_D6E05552_4E2F_43D9_869A_968020C89F4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78e3a8123c9397255d65725d040ea7f8fd17d79a32e2ee81c3f923dd7d1b29a1
#. default-sha256: 069ad2141a06bbf069830e33b91cb7e3564f79b18a137b41985e7ce13d8dcbfd
msgctxt "search2:search2_D6E05552_4E2F_43D9_869A_968020C89F4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So I made my next wish.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I wished for their reconstruction.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"I wished eternal suffering on their souls.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I wished to trap them in a neverending "
"cycle of pain and hatred."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Così espressi un altro desiderio.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Desiderai la loro ricostruzione.⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Desiderai che le loro anime soffrissero in eterno.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Desiderai di "
"intrappolarli in un ciclo infinito di dolore e disprezzo."

#: search2:search2_FE3D1120_E72C_48DB_AB18_059719F975AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e42917af7305e326bf7651dc44910219227c42af3f03ee3e5897ef33004670f
#. default-sha256: 4622c171f4e556728de1a98c18887983b7d0267624824414ce3a777f10cef8e9
msgctxt "search2:search2_FE3D1120_E72C_48DB_AB18_059719F975AC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫This was my wish for the flaxen-haired young man:⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫He treasured his "
"dear sister, and he desired a quiet life, ⟪k:6⟫so I wished for him to have just that. ⟪k:7⟫And I "
"wished for his dearly beloved sister to love him more than anything in the world! ⟪k:8⟫For his "
"world to be destroyed by love gone too far!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Questo è ciò che desiderai per il ragazzo dai cappelli dorati:⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Lui "
"amava la sua cara dolce sorella, e voleva condurre una vita tranquilla, ⟪k:6⟫perciò desiderai per "
"lui proprio questo. ⟪k:7⟫Desiderai che la sua adorata sorella lo amasse più di ogni altra cosa! "
"⟪k:8⟫E che il suo mondo venisse distrutto da un amore spintosi troppo oltre!"

#: search2:search2_3575F672_880D_4535_A24E_D9CC7C0E5B67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1f9d4549a2e56ad59b03a3a02097db27eb5ff3eb5417edc79c1ec36c661789c
#. default-sha256: 6feff36387afdca045c4a9d20d94229387b400a15378af134a818faa478e5e2f
msgctxt "search2:search2_3575F672_880D_4535_A24E_D9CC7C0E5B67"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My wish for the lord was more straightforward:⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫He seemed to have "
"great affection for wealth and authority, so I ensured those were the only things he could ever "
"have. ⟪k:6⟫Who needs love or friendship when you could be drowning in power? ⟪k:7⟫Once he had "
"lost everything, ⟪k:8⟫his solitude would be his only companion!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ciò che desideravo per il lord era più semplice e diretto:⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Sembrava "
"che avesse un grande attaccamento alla ricchezza e all’autorità, così mi assicurai che quelle "
"fossero le uniche cose che avrebbe mai potuto avere. ⟪k:6⟫Chi ha bisogno dell’amore e "
"dell’amicizia quando puoi sguazzare nel potere? ⟪k:7⟫Dopo aver perso ogni cosa,⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫la "
"solitudine sarebbe stata la sua unica compagna!"

