msgid "⟪k:0⟫Make them suffer here for all eternity—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫in this house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Se li facessimo soffrire per l’eternità, qui—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫in questa casa?"

